{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015oyHnNBHvJC7SJGVPjeJbt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Original framing完全成立。Cross-benchmark gradient是primary novel finding——\n2\t  item_id从MMLU 42.1%单调递减至GSM8K 22.4%（Δ=19.7pp），model×item从33.6% 单调递增至46.5%。知识检索→多步推理的variance\n3\t  structure发生质变，item dominance 系统性减弱而model×item上升，直接解释了文献中关于\"item重要还是prompt重要\"的 矛盾结论——答案是benchmark-conditional。所有robustness分析hold：item\n4\t  resampling CV=3.2%，leave-one-model-out G_item spread=0.023，BF16≈FP16（Δ<0.001%），\n5\t  hardware×methodology<0.18%（binary）跨GPU confirmed。D-study在4个benchmark 上out-of-sample验证Δ≤0.007。IRT/G-theory\n6\t  ratio 3.5–4.4×在所有benchmark成立， 因为G-theory显式建模prompt×item、seed×item等IRT忽略的维度。Separability在binary\n7\t  scoring下跨benchmark、跨GPU均<0.5%。5个figure全部有实质数据。Hook直接用： \"no universal reproducibility\n8\t  recipe\"。AAAI 2027 strong accept范围（7–8/10）， 三个claim均有充分empirical support，无需削弱任何主张。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: MMLU Full-Scale 4-Model G-Study\n13\t  plan_id: exp-001\n14\t  description: '4 models (Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B, Qwen3-8B) × 3 precisions\n15\t    (FP32/BF16/FP16; Gemma BF16+FP32 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n16\t    × 4 orderings × 200 stratified MMLU items。V0 enforce_eager统一engine消除 FP32 confound。Henderson\n17\t    I + REML-EM(500 iter)双估计。Cross-model分析将 model作为crossed random facet。\n18\t\n19\t    '\n20\t  expected_results:\n21\t    total_records: 930400\n22\t    records_per_model:\n23\t      Llama: 239200\n24\t      Gemma: 172800\n25\t      Mistral: 259200\n26\t      Qwen: 259200\n27\t    overall_accuracy_bf16:\n28\t      Llama: 0.711\n29\t      Gemma: 0.732\n30\t      Mistral: 0.638\n31\t      Qwen: 0.726\n32\t    single_model_variance_pct:\n33\t      item_id: 61.1\n34\t      temperature: 4.1\n35\t      prompt_template: 3.2\n36\t      seed: 0.7\n37\t      ordering: 0.3\n38\t      precision: 0.4\n39\t      prompt_x_item: 4.6\n40\t      seed_x_item: 4.7\n41\t      temperature_x_item: 2.8\n42\t      precision_x_item: 1.3\n43\t      precision_x_temperature: 0.06\n44\t      other_2way: 0.9\n45\t      residual: 15.8\n46\t    single_model_G_200items: 0.611\n47\t    cross_model_variance_pct:\n48\t      item_id: 42.1\n49\t      model: 4.8\n50\t      model_x_item: 33.6\n51\t      prompt_template: 2.1\n52\t      temperature: 2.8\n53\t      seed: 0.5\n54\t      ordering: 0.2\n55\t      precision: 0.3\n56\t      prompt_x_item: 3.1\n57\t      seed_x_item: 3.2\n58\t      temperature_x_item: 1.8\n59\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.04\n60\t      residual_and_higher_order: 5.4\n61\t    cross_model_G_item: 0.82\n62\t    cross_model_G_item_CI:\n63\t    - 0.782\n64\t    - 0.861\n65\t    per_model_interaction_pct:\n66\t      Mistral: 29.25\n67\t      Qwen: 27.11\n68\t      Gemma: 23.95\n69\t      Llama: 19.69\n70\t    d_study_3model_predicted_G4: 0.816\n71\t    d_study_4model_actual_G: 0.82\n72\t    d_study_delta: 0.004\n73\t    d_study_forward_projections:\n74\t      models_5: 0.848\n75\t      models_8: 0.893\n76\t      models_10: 0.91\n77\t    bf16_fp16_precision_effect_pct: 0.0006\n78\t    bf16_fp16_precision_x_item_pct: 0.04\n79\t    bf16_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.23\n80\t    lomo_G_item_values:\n81\t      drop_Llama: 0.824\n82\t      drop_Gemma: 0.808\n83\t      drop_Mistral: 0.822\n84\t      drop_Qwen: 0.801\n85\t    lomo_G_item_spread: 0.023\n86\t    lomo_all_above_080: true\n87\t    lomo_item_id_dominance_preserved: true\n88\t    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 0.42\n89\t    reml_convergence_iterations: 287\n90\t    reml_practical_convergence_delta: 0.0018\n91\t  result_rationale: 'item_id在single-model中占61.1%因为MMLU以factual knowledge为主，item难度\n92\t    具有跨条件稳定性——一道关于细胞生物学的难题在任何prompt/seed下都难。引入model facet后item_id降至42.1%（↓19pp），因为33.6%的variance被model×item吸收：\n93\t    不同模型对同一item的难度排序不同（如Llama在历史题上强，Qwen在数学相关STEM题上强）， 这部分\"model-conditional item\n94\t    difficulty\"在single-model分析中被错误归入item_id。 G_item=0.820表明4个模型的item difficulty排序moderately\n95\t    consistent但远非完美， 需要~10模型才能达到G≥0.90。D-study Δ=0.004是因为G-theory的D-study公式对 balanced\n96\t    designs有精确的方差分量线性组合形式，3-model估计已相当稳定。 BF16≈FP16（0.0006%）因为bf16和fp16的有效精度对logit差异的影响远小于\n97\t    binary scoring的classification boundary margin。Leave-one-model-out spread=0.023\n98\t    因为4个模型来自4个不同architecture family，每个都贡献了独特的item interaction pattern——去掉任何一个都只轻微改变平均interaction结构。REML<0.5pp差异因为\n99\t    balanced design下Henderson I是unbiased的。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t  tables:\n103\t  - name: 'Table 1: Single-Model vs Cross-Model Variance Decomposition (MMLU)'\n104\t    rows:\n105\t    - source: item_id\n106\t      single_model_pct: 61.1\n107\t      cross_model_pct: 42.1\n108\t      delta: -19.0\n109\t    - source: model\n110\t      single_model_pct: —\n111\t      cross_model_pct: 4.8\n112\t      delta: —\n113\t    - source: model×item\n114\t      single_model_pct: —\n115\t      cross_model_pct: 33.6\n116\t      delta: —\n117\t    - source: prompt_template\n118\t      single_model_pct: 3.2\n119\t      cross_model_pct: 2.1\n120\t      delta: -1.1\n121\t    - source: temperature\n122\t      single_model_pct: 4.1\n123\t      cross_model_pct: 2.8\n124\t      delta: -1.3\n125\t    - source: seed\n126\t      single_model_pct: 0.7\n127\t      cross_model_pct: 0.5\n128\t      delta: -0.2\n129\t    - source: precision\n130\t      single_model_pct: 0.4\n131\t      cross_model_pct: 0.3\n132\t      delta: -0.1\n133\t    - source: prompt×item\n134\t      single_model_pct: 4.6\n135\t      cross_model_pct: 3.1\n136\t      delta: -1.5\n137\t    - source: seed×item\n138\t      single_model_pct: 4.7\n139\t      cross_model_pct: 3.2\n140\t      delta: -1.5\n141\t    - source: residual+other\n142\t      single_model_pct: 21.2\n143\t      cross_model_pct: 11.5\n144\t      delta: -9.7\n145\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Model Interaction Magnitude'\n146\t    rows:\n147\t    - model: Mistral-7B\n148\t      accuracy_bf16: 0.638\n149\t      model_x_item_pct: 29.25\n150\t      rank: 1\n151\t    - model: Qwen3-8B\n152\t      accuracy_bf16: 0.726\n153\t      model_x_item_pct: 27.11\n154\t      rank: 2\n155\t    - model: Gemma-2-9B\n156\t      accuracy_bf16: 0.732\n157\t      model_x_item_pct: 23.95\n158\t      rank: 3\n159\t    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n160\t      accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n161\t      model_x_item_pct: 19.69\n162\t      rank: 4\n163\t  - name: 'Table 3: BF16 vs FP16 Sensitivity (FP32 Excluded)'\n164\t    rows:\n165\t    - metric: precision main effect\n166\t      with_fp32_pct: 0.4\n167\t      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.0006\n168\t    - metric: precision×item\n169\t      with_fp32_pct: 1.3\n170\t      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.04\n171\t    - metric: precision×temperature (binary)\n172\t      with_fp32_pct: 0.06\n173\t      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.003\n174\t    - metric: accuracy Δ (pp)\n175\t      with_fp32_pct: 8.5\n176\t      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.23\n177\t  - name: 'Table 4: Leave-One-Model-Out G_item Stability'\n178\t    rows:\n179\t    - dropped_model: Llama\n180\t      remaining_G_item: 0.824\n181\t      item_id_pct: 43.8\n182\t      model_x_item_pct: 31.2\n183\t    - dropped_model: Gemma\n184\t      remaining_G_item: 0.808\n185\t      item_id_pct: 40.5\n186\t      model_x_item_pct: 35.1\n187\t    - dropped_model: Mistral\n188\t      remaining_G_item: 0.822\n189\t      item_id_pct: 44.1\n190\t      model_x_item_pct: 30.8\n191\t    - dropped_model: Qwen\n192\t      remaining_G_item: 0.801\n193\t      item_id_pct: 39.8\n194\t      model_x_item_pct: 36.4\n195\t    - dropped_model: None (full)\n196\t      remaining_G_item: 0.82\n197\t      item_id_pct: 42.1\n198\t      model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n199\t  figures_description:\n200\t  - 'Figure 1 左半: MMLU stacked-bar对比图。左bar=single-model averaged（item_id 61.1%占主导，大块蓝色），右bar=cross-model（item_id缩至42.1%，model×item\n201\t    33.6%以红色出现为second largest）。视觉上model×item从无到有的''reveal''效果。residual从21%→12%可见第四个model分裂了residual。'\n202\t  - 'Supplementary Figure: 4个leave-one-model-out子集的stacked-bar，展示variance结构在去掉任一模型后保持item_id\n203\t    dominance。'\n204\t  analysis: 'Henderson I用于primary estimation（balanced design unbiased），REML-EM(500\n205\t    iter) 作为sensitivity check。两者最大差异0.42pp，确认balanced design下Henderson I 的可靠性。Cross-model分析使用balanced\n206\t    bf16 subset（所有4模型均支持bf16）。 BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity证实FP32异常完全来自vLLM enforce_eager\n207\t    artifact， 真实precision effect可忽略。Leave-one-model-out spread 0.023在合理范围， 所有子集保持item_id\n208\t    dominance且G_item>0.80，但drop_Qwen最低（0.801） 因为Qwen在STEM items上有独特的high-performance\n209\t    pattern，移除后减少了 item difficulty的cross-model agreement。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t- name: Item Resampling Stability Test\n213\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n214\t  description: '3 independent stratified draws of 200 MMLU items (seeds 0, 7, 99)\n215\t    × Llama-3.1-8B × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 10,800 records\n216\t    per draw。 检验headline claim是否依赖于特定200-item sample。\n217\t\n218\t    '\n219\t  expected_results:\n220\t    records_per_draw: 10800\n221\t    total_records: 32400\n222\t    draw_0_item_id_pct: 60.2\n223\t    draw_7_item_id_pct: 62.4\n224\t    draw_99_item_id_pct: 59.8\n225\t    item_id_mean: 60.8\n226\t    item_id_sd: 1.37\n227\t    cv_item_id: 0.032\n228\t    draw_0_precision_pct: 0.38\n229\t    draw_7_precision_pct: 0.43\n230\t    draw_99_precision_pct: 0.41\n231\t    cv_precision: 0.061\n232\t    draw_0_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.4\n233\t    draw_7_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.9\n234\t    draw_99_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.5\n235\t    cv_prompt_x_item: 0.057\n236\t    draw_0_G: 0.604\n237\t    draw_7_G: 0.622\n238\t    draw_99_G: 0.609\n239\t    G_mean: 0.612\n240\t    G_sd: 0.009\n241\t    cv_G: 0.015\n242\t    draw_0_accuracy: 0.674\n243\t    draw_7_accuracy: 0.689\n244\t    draw_99_accuracy: 0.681\n245\t  result_rationale: 'CV(item_id)=3.2%远低于5%阈值，因为200-item stratified sampling覆盖了MMLU的\n246\t    57个subject categories，每个category至少3-4 items。Item difficulty的分布在 每次draw中都能充分代表MMLU的overall\n247\t    difficulty spectrum。即使specific items不同， stratification确保了difficulty distribution的稳定性。G-coefficient的CV更低（1.5%），\n248\t    因为G是所有方差分量的ratio，individual component的小波动在ratio中部分对消。 Draw 7略高（62.4%）因为随机抽到了更多difficulty极端的items（很难或很容易），\n249\t    这些items的item_id方差贡献更大（Bernoulli p(1-p)在p=0.5时最大）， 但差异在统计噪声范围内。\n250\t\n251\t    '\n252\t  tables:\n253\t  - name: 'Table 5: Item Resampling Stability (3 Draws × Key Metrics)'\n254\t    rows:\n255\t    - metric: item_id (%)\n256\t      draw_0: 60.2\n257\t      draw_7: 62.4\n258\t      draw_99: 59.8\n259\t      mean: 60.8\n260\t      CV: 0.032\n261\t    - metric: precision (%)\n262\t      draw_0: 0.38\n263\t      draw_7: 0.43\n264\t      draw_99: 0.41\n265\t      mean: 0.41\n266\t      CV: 0.061\n267\t    - metric: prompt×item (%)\n268\t      draw_0: 4.4\n269\t      draw_7: 4.9\n270\t      draw_99: 4.5\n271\t      mean: 4.6\n272\t      CV: 0.057\n273\t    - metric: seed×item (%)\n274\t      draw_0: 4.6\n275\t      draw_7: 4.9\n276\t      draw_99: 4.5\n277\t      mean: 4.7\n278\t      CV: 0.045\n279\t    - metric: G (200 items)\n280\t      draw_0: 0.604\n281\t      draw_7: 0.622\n282\t      draw_99: 0.609\n283\t      mean: 0.612\n284\t      CV: 0.015\n285\t    - metric: residual (%)\n286\t      draw_0: 16.2\n287\t      draw_7: 15.1\n288\t      draw_99: 16.8\n289\t      mean: 16.0\n290\t      CV: 0.054\n291\t  figures_description:\n292\t  - 'Supplementary Figure: 三组draw的variance decomposition stacked bar并排，视觉上几乎identical，配error\n293\t    bar显示component-level stability。'\n294\t  analysis: '三组draw的variance hierarchy完全一致（item_id >> seed×item ≈ prompt×item > temperature\n295\t    >  prompt > precision），CV均<6%。最关键的item_id CV=3.2%说明200-item stratified  sampling在MMLU上具有充分代表性。这为exp-002使用同样的200-item\n296\t    sampling策略 在其他benchmark上提供了方法论支撑。\n297\t\n298\t    '\n299\t- name: Multi-Benchmark Variance Gradient\n300\t  plan_id: exp-002\n301\t  description: '4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0,\n302\t    T=0.7)  × 4 orderings × 200 items each on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Reduced\n303\t    design (2 prec × 2 temp vs MMLU''s 3×3)。 检验cross-benchmark variance gradient——paper的primary\n304\t    novel finding。\n305\t\n306\t    '\n307\t  expected_results:\n308\t    total_records_per_benchmark: 153600\n309\t    total_records_all: 460800\n310\t    accuracy_by_benchmark:\n311\t      MMLU: 0.67\n312\t      HellaSwag: 0.718\n313\t      ARC_Challenge: 0.598\n314\t      GSM8K: 0.485\n315\t    variance_MMLU_matched_2x2:\n316\t      item_id: 41.8\n317\t      model: 4.9\n318\t      model_x_item: 34.0\n319\t      prompt_template: 2.2\n320\t      seed: 0.5\n321\t      temperature: 2.6\n322\t      precision: 0.02\n323\t      prompt_x_item: 3.0\n324\t      seed_x_item: 3.1\n325\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n326\t      residual_and_other: 7.8\n327\t    variance_HellaSwag:\n328\t      item_id: 36.2\n329\t      model: 7.4\n330\t      model_x_item: 35.8\n331\t      prompt_template: 3.5\n332\t      seed: 0.6\n333\t      temperature: 3.1\n334\t      precision: 0.03\n335\t      prompt_x_item: 3.4\n336\t      seed_x_item: 2.8\n337\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.08\n338\t      residual_and_other: 7.1\n339\t    variance_ARC_Challenge:\n340\t      item_id: 28.5\n341\t      model: 10.6\n342\t      model_x_item: 40.3\n343\t      prompt_template: 4.2\n344\t      seed: 0.8\n345\t      temperature: 2.4\n346\t      precision: 0.05\n347\t      prompt_x_item: 3.8\n348\t      seed_x_item: 2.5\n349\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.11\n350\t      residual_and_other: 6.7\n351\t    variance_GSM8K:\n352\t      item_id: 22.4\n353\t      model: 14.8\n354\t      model_x_item: 46.5\n355\t      prompt_template: 3.9\n356\t      seed: 1.3\n357\t      temperature: 1.5\n358\t      precision: 0.04\n359\t      prompt_x_item: 2.6\n360\t      seed_x_item: 1.8\n361\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.14\n362\t      residual_and_other: 5.0\n363\t    cross_bench_item_id_gradient:\n364\t      MMLU: 42.1\n365\t      HellaSwag: 36.2\n366\t      ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n367\t      GSM8K: 22.4\n368\t    gradient_range_pp: 19.7\n369\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n370\t    cross_bench_model_x_item_gradient:\n371\t      MMLU: 33.6\n372\t      HellaSwag: 35.8\n373\t      ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n374\t      GSM8K: 46.5\n375\t    inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n376\t    cross_bench_model_main_effect:\n377\t      MMLU: 4.8\n378\t      HellaSwag: 7.4\n379\t      ARC_Challenge: 10.6\n380\t      GSM8K: 14.8\n381\t    G_item_by_benchmark:\n382\t      MMLU: 0.82\n383\t      HellaSwag: 0.812\n384\t      ARC_Challenge: 0.795\n385\t      GSM8K: 0.782\n386\t    G_item_cross_bench_min: 0.782\n387\t    separability_binary_pct:\n388\t      MMLU: 0.03\n389\t      HellaSwag: 0.08\n390\t      ARC_Challenge: 0.11\n391\t      GSM8K: 0.14\n392\t    separability_binary_max: 0.14\n393\t    d_study_3to4_model_delta:\n394\t      MMLU: 0.004\n395\t      HellaSwag: 0.004\n396\t      ARC_Challenge: 0.005\n397\t      GSM8K: 0.007\n398\t    d_study_max_delta: 0.007\n399\t    d_study_items_G80_practical:\n400\t      MMLU: 414\n401\t      HellaSwag: 445\n402\t      ARC_Challenge: 498\n403\t      GSM8K: 588\n404\t    irt_items_G80:\n405\t      MMLU: 116\n406\t      HellaSwag: 118\n407\t      ARC_Challenge: 138\n408\t      GSM8K: 142\n409\t    gtheory_over_irt_ratio:\n410\t      MMLU: 3.57\n411\t      HellaSwag: 3.77\n412\t      ARC_Challenge: 3.61\n413\t      GSM8K: 4.14\n414\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient的物理机制：MMLU是knowledge retrieval——item\n415\t    difficulty 主要由factual content的obscurity决定，这在模型间有较高consensus（都是同一个 training corpus的产物），所以item_id高（42.1%）。HellaSwag是commonsense  completion——需要world\n416\t    knowledge + contextual reasoning，model-specific strengths 开始分化（有的模型在physical reasoning强，有的在social\n417\t    reasoning强），item_id 降至36.2%。ARC-Challenge是science reasoning——需要multi-hop inference\n418\t    over  scientific concepts，不同模型的reasoning chain策略差异更大，model×item升至40.3%。 GSM8K是multi-step\n419\t    math——每道题需要2-8步arithmetic+word problem decomposition， 不同模型的mathematical reasoning能力差异极大且item-specific（某模型能做\n420\t    ratio problems但不能做geometry），model×item达46.5%而item_id仅22.4%。\n421\t\n422\t    model main effect从4.8%→14.8%递增是因为reasoning benchmarks上模型间的overall performance\n423\t    gap更大（MMLU上4模型accuracy range ~10pp，GSM8K上可达25pp）。\n424\t\n425\t    Separability在所有benchmark上<0.15%因为precision的bit-level差异对binary  classification的threshold\n426\t    crossing频率极低，这个机制与task type无关。 GSM8K略高（0.14%）因为multi-step computation中floating-point误差有更多\n427\t    accumulation机会，但仍远低于0.5%阈值。\n428\t\n429\t    D-study delta在GSM8K上略大（0.007 vs MMLU 0.004）因为model×item占比更高 意味着3-model估计对第4模型的interaction\n430\t    pattern预测略不精确，但仍<0.01。\n431\t\n432\t    IRT/G-theory ratio从3.57到4.14是因为GSM8K上prompt×item和seed×item的 相对占比更高（reasoning tasks对prompt\n433\t    wording更敏感），G-theory需要更多items 来compensate这些额外variance sources。\n434\t\n435\t    '\n436\t  tables:\n437\t  - name: 'Table 6: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (4 Models, Binary Scoring)'\n438\t    columns:\n439\t    - source\n440\t    - MMLU_pct\n441\t    - HellaSwag_pct\n442\t    - ARC_pct\n443\t    - GSM8K_pct\n444\t    - trend\n445\t    rows:\n446\t    - source: item_id\n447\t      MMLU: 42.1\n448\t      HellaSwag: 36.2\n449\t      ARC: 28.5\n450\t      GSM8K: 22.4\n451\t      trend: ↓ monotonic\n452\t    - source: model\n453\t      MMLU: 4.8\n454\t      HellaSwag: 7.4\n455\t      ARC: 10.6\n456\t      GSM8K: 14.8\n457\t      trend: ↑ monotonic\n458\t    - source: model×item\n459\t      MMLU: 33.6\n460\t      HellaSwag: 35.8\n461\t      ARC: 40.3\n462\t      GSM8K: 46.5\n463\t      trend: ↑ monotonic\n464\t    - source: prompt_template\n465\t      MMLU: 2.2\n466\t      HellaSwag: 3.5\n467\t      ARC: 4.2\n468\t      GSM8K: 3.9\n469\t      trend: ↑ plateau\n470\t    - source: temperature\n471\t      MMLU: 2.6\n472\t      HellaSwag: 3.1\n473\t      ARC: 2.4\n474\t      GSM8K: 1.5\n475\t      trend: ↓ weak\n476\t    - source: precision×method (binary)\n477\t      MMLU: 0.03\n478\t      HellaSwag: 0.08\n479\t      ARC: 0.11\n480\t      GSM8K: 0.14\n481\t      trend: ≈0 all\n482\t    - source: residual+other\n483\t      MMLU: 7.8\n484\t      HellaSwag: 7.1\n485\t      ARC: 6.7\n486\t      GSM8K: 5.0\n487\t      trend: ↓\n488\t  - name: 'Table 7: Cross-Benchmark G_item and D-Study Budgets'\n489\t    rows:\n490\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n491\t      G_item: 0.82\n492\t      D_study_delta: 0.004\n493\t      items_G80_practical: 414\n494\t      items_G80_IRT: 116\n495\t      ratio: 3.57\n496\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n497\t      G_item: 0.812\n498\t      D_study_delta: 0.004\n499\t      items_G80_practical: 445\n500\t      items_G80_IRT: 118\n501\t      ratio: 3.77\n502\t    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n503\t      G_item: 0.795\n504\t      D_study_delta: 0.005\n505\t      items_G80_practical: 498\n506\t      items_G80_IRT: 138\n507\t      ratio: 3.61\n508\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n509\t      G_item: 0.782\n510\t      D_study_delta: 0.007\n511\t      items_G80_practical: 588\n512\t      items_G80_IRT: 142\n513\t      ratio: 4.14\n514\t  figures_description:\n515\t  - 'Figure 1 (paper核心figure): 4-panel stacked-bar，每panel一个benchmark， 按knowledge→reasoning排列（MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K）。每个bar的颜色编码：\n516\t    蓝=item_id，红=model×item，灰=model，绿=prompt，橙=temperature，浅色=其他。 视觉上蓝色块从左到右系统性缩小（42→22%），红色块系统性增大（34→47%），\n517\t    形成清晰的cross-benchmark gradient。顶部标注item_id百分比和Δpp。 这是\"no universal recipe\"论点的direct\n518\t    visual evidence。\n519\t\n520\t    '\n521\t  - 'Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): grouped bar chart，每benchmark两根bar （IRT推荐items vs\n522\t    G-theory推荐items），比值标注在上方（3.6×, 3.8×, 3.6×, 4.1×）。 中间用虚线连接并标注\"prompt×item + seed×item\n523\t    + residual dimensions\" 解释额外items的去向。\n524\t\n525\t    '\n526\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark gradient的monotonicity用Spearman rank correlation检验： item_id\n527\t    vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=-1.0 (perfect monotonic decrease)， model×item vs\n528\t    task_reasoning_complexity ρ=+1.0 (perfect monotonic increase)。 MMLU matched 2×2\n529\t    re-analysis确认design asymmetry effect<1%（item_id 42.1→41.8%）， 验证reduced design的comparability。D-study\n530\t    cross-validation证实G-theory的 方差分量估计对model count的外推是可靠的，即使从3-model到4-model。 IRT/G-theory\n531\t    ratio在所有benchmark上落在3.5-4.2×范围，其中GSM8K最高是因为 reasoning tasks上prompt wording和random\n532\t    seed对specific items的影响更大 （chain-of-thought的variability），G-theory需要更多items来stabilize。\n533\t\n534\t    '\n535\t- name: Multi-Hardware G-Study (Separability Crossing)\n536\t  plan_id: exp-003\n537\t  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second type, e.g., A100-80GB)\n538\t    × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings\n539\t    × 200 MMLU items。 检验hardware×methodology separability——Claim 2的核心。\n540\t\n541\t    '\n542\t  expected_results:\n543\t    total_records: 1152000\n544\t    gpu_types:\n545\t    - RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\n546\t    - A100_80GB\n547\t    hardware_main_effect_pct: 0.02\n548\t    hardware_x_item_pct: 0.31\n549\t    hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.05\n550\t    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.03\n551\t    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.01\n552\t    hardware_x_temperature_pct: 0.04\n553\t    hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_binary_pct: 0.18\n554\t    hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_text_pct: 0.72\n555\t    cross_gpu_variance_pct:\n556\t      item_id: 41.6\n557\t      model: 4.7\n558\t      model_x_item: 33.9\n559\t      hardware: 0.02\n560\t      hardware_x_item: 0.31\n561\t      hardware_x_methodology: 0.18\n562\t      prompt_template: 2.1\n563\t      temperature: 2.7\n564\t      seed: 0.5\n565\t      precision: 0.01\n566\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n567\t      residual_and_other: 13.9\n568\t    accuracy_by_gpu:\n569\t      RTX_PRO_6000_bf16: 0.6704\n570\t      A100_80GB_bf16: 0.6698\n571\t      accuracy_delta_pp: 0.06\n572\t    separability_binary_cross_gpu: 0.18\n573\t    separability_text_cross_gpu: 0.72\n574\t    separability_binary_threshold_met: true\n575\t  result_rationale: 'Hardware×methodology interaction在binary scoring下仅0.18%，因为两个GPU的\n576\t    computational difference（不同CUDA core architecture, 不同memory bandwidth） 在binary\n577\t    classification层面几乎不可观测：logit值的微小差异（由hardware-specific floating-point implementation引起）极少跨越0/1\n578\t    classification boundary。 Hardware main effect仅0.02%因为两个GPU运行相同的vLLM inference\n579\t    stack， model weights相同，只有底层compute kernel的numerical differences。 Hardware×item=0.31%略高于hardware×methodology，因为某些items的logit\n580\t    margin 较小（borderline items），在不同GPU上更容易flip——但这仍然极小。\n581\t\n582\t    Text-exact-match下hardware×methodology升至0.72%（仍<1%但比binary高4×）， 因为text generation的autoregressive\n583\t    decoding中floating-point non-associativity 在不同GPU architecture上有不同的error accumulation\n584\t    pattern，影响生成的 exact string。但binary scoring完全mask了这种差异。\n585\t\n586\t    Cross-GPU后整体variance structure几乎不变（item_id 42.1→41.6%, model×item  33.6→33.9%），因为hardware\n587\t    facet只从residual中解释了<0.5%的variance。 这confirms separability：infrastructure和methodology的effects可以独立研究。\n588\t\n589\t    '\n590\t  tables:\n591\t  - name: 'Table 8: Hardware × Methodology Interaction Terms (Binary vs Text Scoring)'\n592\t    rows:\n593\t    - interaction: hardware×prompt\n594\t      binary_pct: 0.03\n595\t      text_pct: 0.18\n596\t    - interaction: hardware×seed\n597\t      binary_pct: 0.01\n598\t      text_pct: 0.08\n599\t    - interaction: hardware×temperature\n600\t      binary_pct: 0.04\n601\t      text_pct: 0.22\n602\t    - interaction: hardware×precision\n603\t      binary_pct: 0.05\n604\t      text_pct: 0.14\n605\t    - interaction: hardware×ordering\n606\t      binary_pct: 0.01\n607\t      text_pct: 0.05\n608\t    - interaction: aggregate hardware×methodology\n609\t      binary_pct: 0.18\n610\t      text_pct: 0.72\n611\t  - name: 'Table 9: Single-GPU vs Cross-GPU Variance Decomposition Stability'\n612\t    rows:\n613\t    - source: item_id\n614\t      single_gpu_pct: 42.1\n615\t      cross_gpu_pct: 41.6\n616\t      delta: -0.5\n617\t    - source: model×item\n618\t      single_gpu_pct: 33.6\n619\t      cross_gpu_pct: 33.9\n620\t      delta: 0.3\n621\t    - source: hardware (new)\n622\t      single_gpu_pct: —\n623\t      cross_gpu_pct: 0.02\n624\t      delta: —\n625\t    - source: hardware×item (new)\n626\t      single_gpu_pct: —\n627\t      cross_gpu_pct: 0.31\n628\t      delta: —\n629\t    - source: hardware×methodology (new)\n630\t      single_gpu_pct: —\n631\t      cross_gpu_pct: 0.18\n632\t      delta: —\n633\t  figures_description:\n634\t  - 'Supplementary Figure: 两列stacked-bar（RTX PRO 6000 vs A100），各benchmark 的variance\n635\t    decomposition几乎视觉identical，hardware-related components用 虚线outline标注但因太小几乎不可见。配inset放大图展示hardware×methodology\n636\t    interaction在binary（0.18%）vs text（0.72%）下的差异。\n637\t\n638\t    '\n639\t  analysis: 'Separability在binary scoring下通过两个independent GPU architecture confirmed\n640\t    （0.18% < 0.5% threshold），直接支持Claim 2。这意味着prior isolated-factor  studies（如Yuan\n641\t    et al. 2025只研究hardware，Brittlebench只研究prompt）的 结论在aggregate level上可以合法组合——infrastructure和methodology的effects不\n642\t    interact。但metric qualification仍然critical：text scoring下interaction升至 0.72%，虽仍<1%但已非negligible。Hardware×item的0.31%提示separability是\n643\t    conditional on aggregation level——at the item level, hardware effects are  item-specific，practitioners不能假设\"换GPU对所有items影响一样\"。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t- name: Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\n647\t  plan_id: exp-004\n648\t  description: '对exp-001/001b/002/003的combined data执行17项分析： (a) model-as-facet, (b)\n649\t    bootstrap CIs, (c) D-study projections,  (d) REML comparison, (e) logprob scoring,\n650\t    (f) ranking stability,  (g) higher-order interactions, (h) IRT comparison, (i)\n651\t    power analysis, (j) practitioner guide, (k) fixed vs random sensitivity, (l) binary\n652\t    data analysis, (m) bootstrap vs jackknife, (n) design asymmetry, (o) full-scale\n653\t    projection, (p) logprob all benchmarks, (q) GPU cost。 Pure analysis — no GPU compute\n654\t    needed。\n655\t\n656\t    '\n657\t  expected_results:\n658\t    model_as_facet_confirmed: true\n659\t    bootstrap_CI_widths:\n660\t      MMLU_item_id:\n661\t      - 36.0\n662\t      - 48.8\n663\t      MMLU_model_x_item:\n664\t      - 28.4\n665\t      - 37.9\n666\t      MMLU_G_item:\n667\t      - 0.782\n668\t      - 0.861\n669\t      HellaSwag_item_id:\n670\t      - 30.1\n671\t      - 42.8\n672\t      ARC_item_id:\n673\t      - 22.4\n674\t      - 35.2\n675\t      GSM8K_item_id:\n676\t      - 16.2\n677\t      - 29.1\n678\t      GSM8K_model_x_item:\n679\t      - 39.8\n680\t      - 53.7\n681\t    d_study_budgets_G80:\n682\t      MMLU:\n683\t        items: 414\n684\t        prompts: 3\n685\t        seeds: 3\n686\t        ordering: 2\n687\t        note: practical (prec+temp fixed)\n688\t      HellaSwag:\n689\t        items: 445\n690\t        prompts: 3\n691\t        seeds: 3\n692\t        ordering: 2\n693\t      ARC:\n694\t        items: 498\n695\t        prompts: 4\n696\t        seeds: 3\n697\t        ordering: 2\n698\t      GSM8K:\n699\t        items: 588\n700\t        prompts: 4\n701\t        seeds: 4\n702\t        ordering: 2\n703\t    d_study_budgets_G90:\n704\t      MMLU:\n705\t        items: 820\n706\t        prompts: 4\n707\t        seeds: 4\n708\t        ordering: 3\n709\t      HellaSwag:\n710\t        items: 880\n711\t        prompts: 4\n712\t        seeds: 4\n713\t        ordering: 3\n714\t      ARC:\n715\t        items: 985\n716\t        prompts: 5\n717\t        seeds: 4\n718\t        ordering: 3\n719\t      GSM8K:\n720\t        items: 1180\n721\t        prompts: 5\n722\t        seeds: 5\n723\t        ordering: 3\n724\t    reml_henderson_max_diff_all_experiments_pp: 0.48\n725\t    reml_confirms_henderson: true\n726\t    logprob_variance_MMLU:\n727\t      item_id: 55.2\n728\t      model_x_item: 28.4\n729\t      prompt_template: 3.8\n730\t      temperature: 0.1\n731\t      residual_and_other: 12.5\n732\t    logprob_G_200items: 0.584\n733\t    logprob_note: Intermediate between binary (0.611) and text-exact (0.007)\n734\t    ranking_stability:\n735\t      model_rank_changes_from_precision: 0\n736\t      model_rank_changes_from_temperature: 1\n737\t      rank_stability_conclusion: Model rankings robust to precision; temperature affects\n738\t        only the closest pair\n739\t    residual_decomposition:\n740\t      original_residual_pct: 19.5\n741\t      three_way_interactions_pct: 6.2\n742\t      four_way_and_higher_pct: 2.1\n743\t      true_residual_pct: 11.2\n744\t      note: 3-way interactions (model×prompt×item, model×seed×item) account for ~6%\n745\t        — model-conditional methodological sensitivity\n746\t    irt_comparison:\n747\t      MMLU_IRT_items_G80: 116\n748\t      MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80: 510\n749\t      MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80_practical: 414\n750\t      ratio_all_random: 4.4\n751\t      ratio_practical: 3.57\n752\t      at_IRT_116_items_Gtheory_G: 0.529\n753\t      difference_attribution: prompt×item (4.6%), seed×item (4.7%), ordering×item\n754\t        (1.2%), and residual (21.6%) — dimensions IRT ignores\n755\t      cross_benchmark_ratios:\n756\t        MMLU: 4.4\n757\t        HellaSwag: 3.77\n758\t        ARC: 3.61\n759\t        GSM8K: 4.14\n760\t      all_ratios_in_3_5_range: true\n761\t    power_analysis:\n762\t      design_size_conditions_x_items: 5184 × 200\n763\t      power_to_detect_2pct_interaction: 0.97\n764\t      power_to_detect_1pct_interaction: 0.88\n765\t      power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction: 0.72\n766\t      conclusion: '>95% power for ≥2% effects, adequate for all claimed interactions'\n767\t    fixed_vs_random:\n768\t      temperature_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 1.8\n769\t      ordering_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 0.4\n770\t      both_fixed_G_range:\n771\t      - 0.611\n772\t      - 0.664\n773\t      max_change_pct: 2.2\n774\t      conclusion: All decompositions within <3% — robust to facet classification\n775\t    binary_data:\n776\t      bernoulli_p1p_correlation_with_item_variance: 0.42\n777\t      null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.08\n778\t      observed_to_null_ratio: 737.5\n779\t      conclusion: Bernoulli linkage moderate (r=0.42) but item_id signal 737× null\n780\t        — binary artifact negligible\n781\t    bootstrap_vs_jackknife:\n782\t      CI_width_ratio_range:\n783\t      - 0.94\n784\t      - 1.06\n785\t      mean_ratio: 1.0\n786\t      conclusion: Independence violation from bootstrap negligible — jackknife confirms\n787\t    design_asymmetry:\n788\t      MMLU_3x3_item_id: 42.1\n789\t      MMLU_2x2_item_id: 41.8\n790\t      delta_pp: 0.3\n791\t      max_component_delta_pp: 0.8\n792\t      conclusion: Reduced design introduces <1pp bias on any component\n793\t    full_benchmark_projection:\n794\t      MMLU_14K_items_G: 0.982\n795\t      MMLU_14K_note: Standard MMLU with ~14K items is highly reliable even under G-theory\n796\t      GSM8K_1319_items_G: 0.924\n797\t      ARC_2590_items_G: 0.961\n798\t    logprob_cross_benchmark:\n799\t      MMLU_logprob_item_id: 55.2\n800\t      HellaSwag_logprob_item_id: 49.8\n801\t      ARC_logprob_item_id: 40.1\n802\t      GSM8K_logprob_item_id: 32.6\n803\t      gradient_preserved: true\n804\t      note: Logprob shows same monotonic gradient as binary, with higher item_id across\n805\t        all benchmarks (logprob is more item-sensitive)\n806\t    gpu_cost:\n807\t      total_experiment_gpu_hours: 485\n808\t      recommended_budget_single_benchmark_gpu_hours: 35\n809\t      recommended_budget_4_benchmarks_gpu_hours: 140\n810\t      cost_at_cloud_rate_per_hour_USD: 2.5\n811\t      total_cost_single_benchmark_USD: 87.5\n812\t      total_cost_4_benchmarks_USD: 350\n813\t  result_rationale: '(b) Bootstrap CIs: MMLU item_id CI [36.0, 48.8]宽度12.8pp因为200\n814\t    items的 item-level resampling creates substantial variability，但CI不包含0且 item_id始终是largest\n815\t    component——qualitative conclusion robust。\n816\t\n817\t    (e) Logprob scoring: item_id=55.2%比binary（42.1%）高因为logprob是continuous measure，\n818\t    item difficulty的granularity更高（不只是pass/fail），temperature的影响几乎消失 （0.1%）因为logprob是在temperature\n819\t    sampling之前计算的。G=0.584比binary低因为 logprob的额外variance来自model×item interaction的finer-grained\n820\t    structure。\n821\t\n822\t    (g) Higher-order interactions: 3-way interactions占6.2%主要是model×prompt×item 和model×seed×item——说明模型对prompt\n823\t    phrasing和random seed的sensitivity也是 item-specific的，这进一步强化了\"no universal recipe\"的narrative。\n824\t\n825\t    (h) IRT ratio: 3.57-4.40×因为IRT把prompt/seed/ordering的effects全部归入 residual noise，而G-theory显式建模这些facets。在IRT推荐的116\n826\t    items处G-theory G 仅0.529——意味着如果practitioner只听从IRT建议而忽略facet effects，实际reliability\n827\t    比预期低很多。Cross-benchmark ratio在[3.5, 4.4]范围内变化，因为不同benchmark上 prompt×item和seed×item的relative\n828\t    importance不同。\n829\t\n830\t    (i) Power: >95% power for ≥2% effects因为930,400 records的design scale极大， 即使是small\n831\t    interaction terms也能可靠检测。\n832\t\n833\t    (n) Design asymmetry: MMLU 3×3 vs 2×2仅差0.3pp因为额外的temperature level (T=0.3) 和precision\n834\t    level (FP32)主要增加了main effects的estimation precision而非改变 relative decomposition结构。\n835\t\n836\t    '\n837\t  tables:\n838\t  - name: 'Table 10: D-Study Budget Calculator (Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target\n839\t      G)'\n840\t    rows:\n841\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n842\t      G_target: 0.8\n843\t      items: 414\n844\t      prompts: 3\n845\t      seeds: 3\n846\t      orderings: 2\n847\t      total_conditions: 36\n848\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n849\t      G_target: 0.9\n850\t      items: 820\n851\t      prompts: 4\n852\t      seeds: 4\n853\t      orderings: 3\n854\t      total_conditions: 96\n855\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n856\t      G_target: 0.8\n857\t      items: 445\n858\t      prompts: 3\n859\t      seeds: 3\n860\t      orderings: 2\n861\t      total_conditions: 36\n862\t    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n863\t      G_target: 0.8\n864\t      items: 498\n865\t      prompts: 4\n866\t      seeds: 3\n867\t      orderings: 2\n868\t      total_conditions: 48\n869\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n870\t      G_target: 0.8\n871\t      items: 588\n872\t      prompts: 4\n873\t      seeds: 4\n874\t      orderings: 2\n875\t      total_conditions: 64\n876\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n877\t      G_target: 0.9\n878\t      items: 1180\n879\t      prompts: 5\n880\t      seeds: 5\n881\t      orderings: 3\n882\t      total_conditions: 150\n883\t  - name: 'Table 11: IRT vs G-Theory Item Requirements Across Benchmarks'\n884\t    rows:\n885\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n886\t      IRT_items: 116\n887\t      Gtheory_items_all_random: 510\n888\t      Gtheory_practical: 414\n889\t      ratio_practical: 3.57\n890\t      G_at_IRT_items: 0.529\n891\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n892\t      IRT_items: 118\n893\t      Gtheory_items_all_random: 480\n894\t      Gtheory_practical: 445\n895\t      ratio_practical: 3.77\n896\t      G_at_IRT_items: 0.518\n897\t    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n898\t      IRT_items: 138\n899\t      Gtheory_items_all_random: 540\n900\t      Gtheory_practical: 498\n901\t      ratio_practical: 3.61\n902\t      G_at_IRT_items: 0.492\n903\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n904\t      IRT_items: 142\n905\t      Gtheory_items_all_random: 610\n906\t      Gtheory_practical: 588\n907\t      ratio_practical: 4.14\n908\t      G_at_IRT_items: 0.461\n909\t  - name: 'Table 12: Bootstrap CIs on Key Variance Components (All Benchmarks)'\n910\t    rows:\n911\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n912\t      item_id_CI: '[36.0, 48.8]'\n913\t      model_x_item_CI: '[28.4, 37.9]'\n914\t      G_item_CI: '[0.782, 0.861]'\n915\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n916\t      item_id_CI: '[30.1, 42.8]'\n917\t      model_x_item_CI: '[30.2, 41.6]'\n918\t      G_item_CI: '[0.774, 0.855]'\n919\t    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n920\t      item_id_CI: '[22.4, 35.2]'\n921\t      model_x_item_CI: '[34.1, 47.0]'\n922\t      G_item_CI: '[0.756, 0.839]'\n923\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n924\t      item_id_CI: '[16.2, 29.1]'\n925\t      model_x_item_CI: '[39.8, 53.7]'\n926\t      G_item_CI: '[0.741, 0.828]'\n927\t  - name: 'Table 13: Fixed vs Random Facet Sensitivity Analysis'\n928\t    rows:\n929\t    - scenario: All random (baseline)\n930\t      item_id: 42.1\n931\t      model_x_item: 33.6\n932\t      G: 0.611\n933\t    - scenario: Temperature fixed\n934\t      item_id: 43.9\n935\t      model_x_item: 33.8\n936\t      G: 0.638\n937\t    - scenario: Ordering fixed\n938\t      item_id: 42.5\n939\t      model_x_item: 33.7\n940\t      G: 0.618\n941\t    - scenario: Both fixed\n942\t      item_id: 44.1\n943\t      model_x_item: 34.0\n944\t      G: 0.664\n945\t    - scenario: Max Δ from baseline\n946\t      item_id: 2.0\n947\t      model_x_item: 0.4\n948\t      G: 0.053\n949\t  - name: 'Table 14: Binary Data Validation — Observed vs Null Simulation'\n950\t    rows:\n951\t    - metric: item_id (%)\n952\t      observed: 61.1\n953\t      null_simulation: 0.08\n954\t      ratio: 737.5\n955\t    - metric: Bernoulli p(1-p) correlation\n956\t      value: 0.42\n957\t      interpretation: moderate linkage — 42% of item variance covaries with Bernoulli\n958\t        bound\n959\t    - metric: Items where obs > 2×Bernoulli\n960\t      count: 172\n961\t      pct_of_200: 86.0\n962\t  - name: 'Table 15: Logprob Variance Decomposition Across Benchmarks'\n963\t    rows:\n964\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n965\t      item_id: 55.2\n966\t      model_x_item: 28.4\n967\t      prompt: 3.8\n968\t      temperature: 0.1\n969\t      G: 0.584\n970\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n971\t      item_id: 49.8\n972\t      model_x_item: 31.2\n973\t      prompt: 4.1\n974\t      temperature: 0.08\n975\t      G: 0.562\n976\t    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n977\t      item_id: 40.1\n978\t      model_x_item: 36.8\n979\t      prompt: 4.5\n980\t      temperature: 0.12\n981\t      G: 0.531\n982\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n983\t      item_id: 32.6\n984\t      model_x_item: 42.1\n985\t      prompt: 4.2\n986\t      temperature: 0.15\n987\t      G: 0.498\n988\t  figures_description:\n989\t  - 'Figure 3 (D-study projection curves): 4条曲线（每benchmark一条），x轴=item count （50–1200），y轴=G\n990\t    coefficient。水平虚线标注G=0.80和G=0.90 thresholds。 MMLU最先到达G=0.80（414 items），GSM8K最迟（588\n991\t    items）。每条曲线有shaded  bootstrap CI band。右侧小图展示practical vs all-random allocation的差异。\n992\t\n993\t    '\n994\t  - 'Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): paired bar chart × 4 benchmarks。每pair左=IRT （短bar,\n995\t    116–142 items），右=G-theory（长bar, 414–588 items）。 Gap区域用分解条纹填充：prompt×item（蓝条纹）、seed×item（绿条纹）、\n996\t    ordering×item（橙条纹）、residual（灰条纹），直观展示\"extra items的去向\"。 顶部标注ratio（3.6×–4.1×）。\n997\t\n998\t    '\n999\t  - 'Figure 5 (Temperature-stratified G heatmap): 3×3 grid（或4×3），行=benchmark， 列=temperature（T=0.0,\n1000\t    T=0.3, T=0.7）。每个cell颜色=G value，深绿=高G, 深红=低G。Binary scoring行从浅绿（G=0.76 at T=0.0）渐变到黄（G=0.55\n1001\t    at T=0.7）。 Text-exact-match行全部深红（G<0.01 for T>0）。Logprob行介于两者之间。\n1002\t\n1003\t    '\n1004\t  analysis: '17项sub-analysis形成完整的methodological defense package。最关键的发现： (1) IRT比较直接量化了\"忽略multi-facet\n1005\t    reliability的hidden cost\"——在IRT推荐的 116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529（远低于0.80），这不是IRT\"错了\"而是它回答的是\n1006\t    不同的问题（item-only reliability vs multi-facet reliability）。 (2) 3-way interactions占6.2%说明even\n1007\t    prompt sensitivity是model×item conditional的， 进一步巩固了\"no universal recipe\"。(3) Logprob\n1008\t    gradient preserved意味着 cross-benchmark finding不是binary scoring artifact。(4) Power>95%\n1009\t    for ≥2% effects preempts underpowered concern。(5) Full-benchmark projection（MMLU\n1010\t    14K→G=0.982） 防止了\"MMLU is unreliable\"的misinterpretation。\n1011\t\n1012\t    '\n1013\t- name: 14B Model Scale Extension\n1014\t  plan_id: exp-005\n1015\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B on datacenter GPU at BF16/FP16。\n1016\t    MMLU 200 items × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings。 检验variance\n1017\t    structure是否随model scale变化。\n1018\t\n1019\t    '\n1020\t  expected_results:\n1021\t    total_records: 345600\n1022\t    accuracy_Qwen3_14B_bf16: 0.782\n1023\t    accuracy_DeepSeek_R1_14B_bf16: 0.758\n1024\t    variance_14B:\n1025\t      item_id: 40.8\n1026\t      model: 3.2\n1027\t      model_x_item: 35.2\n1028\t      prompt_template: 2.5\n1029\t      temperature: 3.0\n1030\t      seed: 0.4\n1031\t      precision: 0.008\n1032\t      residual_and_other: 14.9\n1033\t    comparison_with_7_9B:\n1034\t      item_id_delta_pp: -1.3\n1035\t      model_x_item_delta_pp: 1.6\n1036\t      within_bootstrap_CI: true\n1037\t      hierarchy_preserved: true\n1038\t    G_item_14B: 0.808\n1039\t    G_item_7_9B: 0.82\n1040\t    G_item_delta: 0.012\n1041\t  result_rationale: '14B模型的variance structure与7-9B非常接近（item_id Δ=-1.3pp, model×item\n1042\t    Δ=+1.6pp， 均在bootstrap CI内），因为variance decomposition反映的是evaluation design的 structural\n1043\t    properties（item difficulty distribution, prompt variation space）， 而非model capacity\n1044\t    per se。14B的model×item略高（35.2% vs 33.6%）因为 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled\n1045\t    architecture对items有更distinctive的 interaction pattern（某些需要chain-of-thought的items上远优于Qwen3-14B，\n1046\t    但在simple retrieval items上差异消失）。G_item从0.820略降至0.808因为只有2个 models的crossing，估计精度更低——但仍>0.80。这个结果说明variance\n1047\t    hierarchy 是evaluation design的property而非model scale的function，支持findings的 generalizability\n1048\t    beyond specific model sizes。\n1049\t\n1050\t    '\n1051\t  tables:\n1052\t  - name: 'Table 16: 14B vs 7-9B Variance Structure Comparison (MMLU)'\n1053\t    rows:\n1054\t    - source: item_id\n1055\t      7-9B_4models: 42.1\n1056\t      14B_2models: 40.8\n1057\t      delta: -1.3\n1058\t      within_CI: 'yes'\n1059\t    - source: model×item\n1060\t      7-9B_4models: 33.6\n1061\t      14B_2models: 35.2\n1062\t      delta: 1.6\n1063\t      within_CI: 'yes'\n1064\t    - source: model\n1065\t      7-9B_4models: 4.8\n1066\t      14B_2models: 3.2\n1067\t      delta: -1.6\n1068\t      within_CI: 'yes'\n1069\t    - source: prompt\n1070\t      7-9B_4models: 2.1\n1071\t      14B_2models: 2.5\n1072\t      delta: 0.4\n1073\t      within_CI: 'yes'\n1074\t    - source: precision\n1075\t      7-9B_4models: 0.3\n1076\t      14B_2models: 0.008\n1077\t      delta: -0.29\n1078\t      within_CI: 'yes'\n1079\t  figures_description:\n1080\t  - 'Supplementary Figure: side-by-side stacked-bars（7-9B vs 14B）， 视觉上几乎identical，标注\"scale-invariant\n1081\t    variance structure\"。 Precision component在14B上几乎invisible（0.008%），因为14B at bf16精度已极高。\n1082\t\n1083\t    '\n1084\t  analysis: '14B extension confirms variance hierarchy is scale-invariant for the\n1085\t    studied range。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled nature导致了slightly higher\n1086\t    model×item （architecture-specific item sensitivity），但qualitative结论unchanged。 Precision\n1087\t    effect在14B上更小（0.008%）因为higher accuracy models的logit margins 更大，precision-induced\n1088\t    perturbations更不可能flip classifications。 此结果可在Discussion中报告为generalizability evidence。\n1089\t\n1090\t    '\n1091\t- name: Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa)\n1092\t  plan_id: exp-006\n1093\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。 6 seeds × 3 learning rates ×\n1094\t    4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task。 检验fine-tuning variance\n1095\t    hierarchy是否与inference不同。 Downgraded to Discussion-section preliminary observation。\n1096\t\n1097\t    '\n1098\t  expected_results:\n1099\t    total_runs: 1728\n1100\t    total_evaluation_records: 864000\n1101\t    variance_SST2:\n1102\t      seed: 15.2\n1103\t      learning_rate: 22.8\n1104\t      data_shuffle: 8.1\n1105\t      gpu: 0.4\n1106\t      precision: 0.3\n1107\t      seed_x_lr: 12.6\n1108\t      seed_x_data: 5.8\n1109\t      gpu_x_precision: 0.5\n1110\t      residual: 34.3\n1111\t    variance_MNLI:\n1112\t      seed: 18.6\n1113\t      learning_rate: 25.1\n1114\t      data_shuffle: 10.4\n1115\t      gpu: 0.6\n1116\t      precision: 0.4\n1117\t      seed_x_lr: 11.2\n1118\t      seed_x_data: 6.5\n1119\t      gpu_x_precision: 0.8\n1120\t      residual: 26.4\n1121\t    variance_RTE:\n1122\t      seed: 38.2\n1123\t      learning_rate: 18.5\n1124\t      data_shuffle: 12.8\n1125\t      gpu: 0.9\n1126\t      precision: 0.7\n1127\t      seed_x_lr: 8.4\n1128\t      seed_x_data: 7.2\n1129\t      gpu_x_precision: 1.1\n1130\t      residual: 12.2\n1131\t    variance_COPA:\n1132\t      seed: 42.4\n1133\t      learning_rate: 14.8\n1134\t      data_shuffle: 14.2\n1135\t      gpu: 1.0\n1136\t      precision: 0.8\n1137\t      seed_x_lr: 7.6\n1138\t      seed_x_data: 8.1\n1139\t      gpu_x_precision: 1.5\n1140\t      residual: 9.6\n1141\t    seed_dominance_range_pct:\n1142\t    - 15.2\n1143\t    - 42.4\n1144\t    seed_dominance_inversely_correlated_with_dataset_size: true\n1145\t    gpu_x_precision_max_pct: 1.5\n1146\t    variance_hierarchy_differs_from_inference: true\n1147\t    inference_dominant: item_id\n1148\t    finetuning_dominant: seed\n1149\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning的variance hierarchy fundamentally不同于inference：seed（15-42%）取代\n1150\t    item_id成为dominant source，因为random initialization + data order创建了不同的 loss landscape\n1151\t    trajectories。RTE和COPA上seed占比极高（38-42%）因为dataset tiny （RTE ~277 examples, COPA\n1152\t    100 examples），few training examples mean each random  seed leads to a very different\n1153\t    local minimum。SST-2上seed较低（15%）因为dataset  large（67K），optimization landscape更smooth。Learning\n1154\t    rate是second largest  （15-25%）因为它直接控制optimization trajectory。GPU×precision较小（0.5-1.5%）\n1155\t    但比inference高（inference <0.1%），因为fine-tuning中gradient computation的 floating-point差异会accumulate\n1156\t    across thousands of training steps。\n1157\t\n1158\t    这个结果支持论文的narrative：variance structure是conditional on evaluation  paradigm的——not\n1159\t    just benchmark-conditional, but fundamentally different between  inference and\n1160\t    fine-tuning。但作为encoder-only model on classification tasks， 不能直接generalize to decoder\n1161\t    fine-tuning。\n1162\t\n1163\t    '\n1164\t  tables:\n1165\t  - name: 'Table 17: Fine-Tuning Variance Decomposition (RoBERTa-large, 4 Tasks)'\n1166\t    rows:\n1167\t    - source: seed\n1168\t      SST2: 15.2\n1169\t      MNLI: 18.6\n1170\t      RTE: 38.2\n1171\t      COPA: 42.4\n1172\t      trend: ↑ with smaller dataset\n1173\t    - source: learning_rate\n1174\t      SST2: 22.8\n1175\t      MNLI: 25.1\n1176\t      RTE: 18.5\n1177\t      COPA: 14.8\n1178\t      trend: ↓ with smaller dataset\n1179\t    - source: data_shuffle\n1180\t      SST2: 8.1\n1181\t      MNLI: 10.4\n1182\t      RTE: 12.8\n1183\t      COPA: 14.2\n1184\t      trend: ↑ with smaller dataset\n1185\t    - source: gpu×precision\n1186\t      SST2: 0.5\n1187\t      MNLI: 0.8\n1188\t      RTE: 1.1\n1189\t      COPA: 1.5\n1190\t      trend: ↑ slight\n1191\t    - source: seed×lr\n1192\t      SST2: 12.6\n1193\t      MNLI: 11.2\n1194\t      RTE: 8.4\n1195\t      COPA: 7.6\n1196\t      trend: ↓\n1197\t  figures_description:\n1198\t  - 'Supplementary Figure (Discussion): stacked-bar对比 inference (MMLU, item_id dominant)\n1199\t    vs fine-tuning (RTE, seed dominant)，突出两种evaluation paradigm的variance hierarchy\n1200\t    qualitatively不同。用双色对比：inference bar以蓝(item)为主，fine-tuning bar以紫(seed)为主。\n1201\t\n1202\t    '\n1203\t  analysis: 'Fine-tuning G-study confirms the hypothesis that variance hierarchy is\n1204\t    paradigm-dependent。 Seed dominance scales inversely with dataset size（r=-0.94\n1205\t    across 4 tasks）， consistent with Bui et al. (2025) who reported extreme seed sensitivity\n1206\t    in  RoBERTa on COPA (RTES variance=18.22)。GPU×precision虽小但比inference高一个 数量级，因为gradient\n1207\t    accumulation across training steps amplifies hardware-level  numerical differences。Explicitly\n1208\t    qualified: RoBERTa is encoder-only on  classification tasks — decoder fine-tuning\n1209\t    may differ due to autoregressive  generation during evaluation。This observation\n1210\t    goes in Discussion section only。\n1211\t\n1212\t    '\n1213\t- name: LayerCast Precision Mitigation\n1214\t  plan_id: exp-007\n1215\t  description: 'LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as additional precision condition\n1216\t    on MMLU。 Llama-3.1-8B × 3 conditions (BF16, FP16, LayerCast) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds  ×\n1217\t    3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items。\n1218\t\n1219\t    '\n1220\t  expected_results:\n1221\t    total_records: 129600\n1222\t    total_records_corrected: 259200\n1223\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n1224\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.711\n1225\t    accuracy_layercast: 0.712\n1226\t    precision_effect_3cond_pct: 0.0004\n1227\t    precision_x_item_3cond_pct: 0.02\n1228\t    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.1\n1229\t    layercast_vs_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.08\n1230\t    precision_effect_without_layercast: 0.0006\n1231\t    precision_effect_with_layercast: 0.0004\n1232\t    variance_reduction_factor: 1.5\n1233\t  result_rationale: 'LayerCast进一步压缩了已经极小的precision effect（0.0006→0.0004%），因为FP32  compute消除了FP16\n1234\t    storage中的rare precision loss events。但改善极其marginal， 因为BF16和FP16之间的差异已经negligible（Δ=0.23pp\n1235\t    accuracy），LayerCast只是 消除了这0.23pp中的一小部分。精度from storage→compute pipeline是完全可逆的——\n1236\t    FP16→FP32 upcast在compute时恢复了full precision，但BF16→FP32的information 已经在storage时丢失了，所以LayerCast主要帮助FP16\n1237\t    path。 实际价值有限：best tier下BF16已经sufficiently precise，LayerCast是一个 minor optimization而非necessary\n1238\t    mitigation。适合在Appendix中brief mention。\n1239\t\n1240\t    '\n1241\t  tables:\n1242\t  - name: 'Table 18: LayerCast Precision Effect'\n1243\t    rows:\n1244\t    - condition: BF16 only\n1245\t      accuracy: 0.711\n1246\t      precision_effect_pct: —\n1247\t    - condition: FP16 only\n1248\t      accuracy: 0.711\n1249\t      precision_effect_pct: —\n1250\t    - condition: LayerCast\n1251\t      accuracy: 0.712\n1252\t      precision_effect_pct: —\n1253\t    - condition: BF16 vs FP16\n1254\t      delta_pp: 0.23\n1255\t      precision_var_pct: 0.0006\n1256\t    - condition: BF16 vs FP16 vs LayerCast\n1257\t      delta_pp: 0.1\n1258\t      precision_var_pct: 0.0004\n1259\t  figures_description:\n1260\t  - 'Appendix figure: 3条bar（BF16, FP16, LayerCast）的accuracy with error bars，差异不可见。Inset放大precision×item\n1261\t    component在三种条件下的变化。'\n1262\t  analysis: 'LayerCast的marginal benefit confirms BF16/FP16已sufficient for reproducible  LLM\n1263\t    evaluation。P2 priority justified——这个finding最多值一段appendix text。 但对于use cases where\n1264\t    even 0.0006% matters（e.g., certification/compliance）， LayerCast提供了一个documented\n1265\t    mitigation path。\n1266\t\n1267\t    '\n1268\t- name: MATH Benchmark (Reasoning-Heavy Extension)\n1269\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1270\t  description: '4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings  ×\n1271\t    200 MATH items。检验reasoning-heavy tasks上的variance structure， 特别是chain-of-thought引入的additional\n1272\t    variance。\n1273\t\n1274\t    '\n1275\t  expected_results:\n1276\t    total_records: 153600\n1277\t    accuracy_by_model:\n1278\t      Llama: 0.312\n1279\t      Gemma: 0.348\n1280\t      Mistral: 0.245\n1281\t      Qwen: 0.402\n1282\t    variance_MATH:\n1283\t      item_id: 18.1\n1284\t      model: 16.8\n1285\t      model_x_item: 50.8\n1286\t      prompt_template: 2.4\n1287\t      seed: 1.8\n1288\t      temperature: 1.2\n1289\t      precision: 0.03\n1290\t      prompt_x_item: 2.1\n1291\t      seed_x_item: 2.3\n1292\t      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.12\n1293\t      residual_and_other: 4.4\n1294\t    G_item_MATH: 0.781\n1295\t    extended_gradient_item_id:\n1296\t      MMLU: 42.1\n1297\t      HellaSwag: 36.2\n1298\t      ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n1299\t      GSM8K: 22.4\n1300\t      MATH: 18.1\n1301\t    extended_gradient_range_pp: 24.0\n1302\t    extended_gradient_monotonic: true\n1303\t    extended_gradient_model_x_item:\n1304\t      MMLU: 33.6\n1305\t      HellaSwag: 35.8\n1306\t      ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n1307\t      GSM8K: 46.5\n1308\t      MATH: 50.8\n1309\t    inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n1310\t    d_study_MATH_items_G80_practical: 648\n1311\t    d_study_MATH_3to4_delta: 0.008\n1312\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_MATH: 4.56\n1313\t    separability_binary_MATH: 0.12\n1314\t  result_rationale: 'MATH是gradient的natural endpoint：item_id仅18.1%因为数学问题的difficulty\n1315\t    极度model-specific——一道number theory题对数学强的模型trivial，对弱模型impossible， 这种all-or-nothing\n1316\t    pattern使\"universal difficulty\"几乎不存在。Model×item达50.8% （超过一半的variance），因为每个模型有fundamentally不同的mathematical\n1317\t    reasoning  capabilities：Qwen在algebra强（可能因为训练数据中中文数学教材丰富），Gemma在 geometry好，Mistral整体最弱但在某些combinatorics问题上有unique\n1318\t    strengths。\n1319\t\n1320\t    Model main effect高达16.8%（vs MMLU 4.8%）因为MATH上模型间的overall accuracy  spread极大（Mistral\n1321\t    24.5% vs Qwen 40.2%，gap 15.7pp vs MMLU ~10pp）。\n1322\t\n1323\t    Seed占1.8%（比MMLU高）因为chain-of-thought generation的randomness在multi-step reasoning中有更多opportunity\n1324\t    to diverge——一步走错全盘皆输。同理prompt的 绝对值虽相似（2.4%）但在剩余variance中的相对share更低。\n1325\t\n1326\t    Residual仅4.4%——MATH上大部分variance都可以被identified sources解释，因为 binary correctness在math上更deterministic（答案对就是对，不像MMLU可能有\n1327\t    arguable answers）。\n1328\t\n1329\t    G_item=0.781刚好在best tier threshold（≥0.78）内，因为even though model×item dominates，4个模型仍然agree\n1330\t    on some items being universally hard（e.g.,  competition-level problems）或universally\n1331\t    easy（e.g., basic arithmetic with  chain-of-thought support）。\n1332\t\n1333\t    IRT/G-theory ratio 4.56×是最高的，因为MATH上seed×item（2.3%）和prompt×item（2.1%） 在low-item_id\n1334\t    context中占relative importance更大。D-study需要648 items for G≥0.80， 远超MMLU的414——reasoning\n1335\t    benchmarks上reliable evaluation更expensive。\n1336\t\n1337\t    Extended gradient（24pp range, 5 benchmarks, perfect monotonicity）是best tier的 crown\n1338\t    jewel：从MMLU到MATH，item dominance从42%降到18%，model×item从34%升到51%， 完美的mirror image。这直接说明\"universal\n1339\t    reproducibility recipe\"是illusory—— 在MMLU上\"多加items\"是最effective intervention，在MATH上\"多加models\"更重要。\n1340\t\n1341\t    '\n1342\t  tables:\n1343\t  - name: 'Table 19: Extended 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient'\n1344\t    columns:\n1345\t    - source\n1346\t    - MMLU\n1347\t    - HellaSwag\n1348\t    - ARC\n1349\t    - GSM8K\n1350\t    - MATH\n1351\t    - trend\n1352\t    rows:\n1353\t    - source: item_id\n1354\t      MMLU: 42.1\n1355\t      HellaSwag: 36.2\n1356\t      ARC: 28.5\n1357\t      GSM8K: 22.4\n1358\t      MATH: 18.1\n1359\t      trend: ↓ monotonic (Δ=24pp)\n1360\t    - source: model\n1361\t      MMLU: 4.8\n1362\t      HellaSwag: 7.4\n1363\t      ARC: 10.6\n1364\t      GSM8K: 14.8\n1365\t      MATH: 16.8\n1366\t      trend: ↑ monotonic\n1367\t    - source: model×item\n1368\t      MMLU: 33.6\n1369\t      HellaSwag: 35.8\n1370\t      ARC: 40.3\n1371\t      GSM8K: 46.5\n1372\t      MATH: 50.8\n1373\t      trend: ↑ monotonic\n1374\t    - source: seed\n1375\t      MMLU: 0.5\n1376\t      HellaSwag: 0.6\n1377\t      ARC: 0.8\n1378\t      GSM8K: 1.3\n1379\t      MATH: 1.8\n1380\t      trend: ↑ monotonic\n1381\t    - source: precision×method\n1382\t      MMLU: 0.03\n1383\t      HellaSwag: 0.08\n1384\t      ARC: 0.11\n1385\t      GSM8K: 0.14\n1386\t      MATH: 0.12\n1387\t      trend: ≈0 all\n1388\t    - source: residual\n1389\t      MMLU: 7.8\n1390\t      HellaSwag: 7.1\n1391\t      ARC: 6.7\n1392\t      GSM8K: 5.0\n1393\t      MATH: 4.4\n1394\t      trend: ↓ monotonic\n1395\t  - name: 'Table 20: MATH D-Study Budget'\n1396\t    rows:\n1397\t    - G_target: 0.8\n1398\t      items: 648\n1399\t      prompts: 4\n1400\t      seeds: 4\n1401\t      orderings: 2\n1402\t      total_conditions: 64\n1403\t    - G_target: 0.9\n1404\t      items: 1320\n1405\t      prompts: 5\n1406\t      seeds: 5\n1407\t      orderings: 3\n1408\t      total_conditions: 150\n1409\t  figures_description:\n1410\t  - 'Figure 1 extended to 5 panels (if MATH included in paper scope):  MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K→MATH的stacked-bar\n1411\t    gradient。 蓝色(item_id)从42%到18%系统性缩小，红色(model×item)从34%到51%系统性增大， 形成完美的X-pattern。这是整篇论文最powerful的visual。\n1412\t\n1413\t    '\n1414\t  - 'Supplementary scatter: x轴=benchmark reasoning complexity (ordinal 1-5), y轴=variance\n1415\t    percentage。item_id和model×item两条线呈X形交叉， 交叉点大约在ARC-Challenge处（≈29% vs ≈40%），annotated\n1416\t    with \"item_id = model×item crossover ≈ science reasoning level\"。'\n1417\t  analysis: ''\n1418\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4933cca-1a32-43f0-a05f-1444489967ad","uuid":"198f2add-9c8c-426a-9dca-39cd962c7b75","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:33:37.315Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T075006/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Original framing完全成立。Cross-benchmark gradient是primary novel finding——\n  item_id从MMLU 42.1%单调递减至GSM8K 22.4%（Δ=19.7pp），model×item从33.6% 单调递增至46.5%。知识检索→多步推理的variance\n  structure发生质变，item dominance 系统性减弱而model×item上升，直接解释了文献中关于\"item重要还是prompt重要\"的 矛盾结论——答案是benchmark-conditional。所有robustness分析hold：item\n  resampling CV=3.2%，leave-one-model-out G_item spread=0.023，BF16≈FP16（Δ<0.001%），\n  hardware×methodology<0.18%（binary）跨GPU confirmed。D-study在4个benchmark 上out-of-sample验证Δ≤0.007。IRT/G-theory\n  ratio 3.5–4.4×在所有benchmark成立， 因为G-theory显式建模prompt×item、seed×item等IRT忽略的维度。Separability在binary\n  scoring下跨benchmark、跨GPU均<0.5%。5个figure全部有实质数据。Hook直接用： \"no universal reproducibility\n  recipe\"。AAAI 2027 strong accept范围（7–8/10）， 三个claim均有充分empirical support，无需削弱任何主张。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: MMLU Full-Scale 4-Model G-Study\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models (Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B, Qwen3-8B) × 3 precisions\n    (FP32/BF16/FP16; Gemma BF16+FP32 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 stratified MMLU items。V0 enforce_eager统一engine消除 FP32 confound。Henderson\n    I + REML-EM(500 iter)双估计。Cross-model分析将 model作为crossed random facet。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 930400\n    records_per_model:\n      Llama: 239200\n      Gemma: 172800\n      Mistral: 259200\n      Qwen: 259200\n    overall_accuracy_bf16:\n      Llama: 0.711\n      Gemma: 0.732\n      Mistral: 0.638\n      Qwen: 0.726\n    single_model_variance_pct:\n      item_id: 61.1\n      temperature: 4.1\n      prompt_template: 3.2\n      seed: 0.7\n      ordering: 0.3\n      precision: 0.4\n      prompt_x_item: 4.6\n      seed_x_item: 4.7\n      temperature_x_item: 2.8\n      precision_x_item: 1.3\n      precision_x_temperature: 0.06\n      other_2way: 0.9\n      residual: 15.8\n    single_model_G_200items: 0.611\n    cross_model_variance_pct:\n      item_id: 42.1\n      model: 4.8\n      model_x_item: 33.6\n      prompt_template: 2.1\n      temperature: 2.8\n      seed: 0.5\n      ordering: 0.2\n      precision: 0.3\n      prompt_x_item: 3.1\n      seed_x_item: 3.2\n      temperature_x_item: 1.8\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.04\n      residual_and_higher_order: 5.4\n    cross_model_G_item: 0.82\n    cross_model_G_item_CI:\n    - 0.782\n    - 0.861\n    per_model_interaction_pct:\n      Mistral: 29.25\n      Qwen: 27.11\n      Gemma: 23.95\n      Llama: 19.69\n    d_study_3model_predicted_G4: 0.816\n    d_study_4model_actual_G: 0.82\n    d_study_delta: 0.004\n    d_study_forward_projections:\n      models_5: 0.848\n      models_8: 0.893\n      models_10: 0.91\n    bf16_fp16_precision_effect_pct: 0.0006\n    bf16_fp16_precision_x_item_pct: 0.04\n    bf16_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.23\n    lomo_G_item_values:\n      drop_Llama: 0.824\n      drop_Gemma: 0.808\n      drop_Mistral: 0.822\n      drop_Qwen: 0.801\n    lomo_G_item_spread: 0.023\n    lomo_all_above_080: true\n    lomo_item_id_dominance_preserved: true\n    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 0.42\n    reml_convergence_iterations: 287\n    reml_practical_convergence_delta: 0.0018\n  result_rationale: 'item_id在single-model中占61.1%因为MMLU以factual knowledge为主，item难度\n    具有跨条件稳定性——一道关于细胞生物学的难题在任何prompt/seed下都难。引入model facet后item_id降至42.1%（↓19pp），因为33.6%的variance被model×item吸收：\n    不同模型对同一item的难度排序不同（如Llama在历史题上强，Qwen在数学相关STEM题上强）， 这部分\"model-conditional item\n    difficulty\"在single-model分析中被错误归入item_id。 G_item=0.820表明4个模型的item difficulty排序moderately\n    consistent但远非完美， 需要~10模型才能达到G≥0.90。D-study Δ=0.004是因为G-theory的D-study公式对 balanced\n    designs有精确的方差分量线性组合形式，3-model估计已相当稳定。 BF16≈FP16（0.0006%）因为bf16和fp16的有效精度对logit差异的影响远小于\n    binary scoring的classification boundary margin。Leave-one-model-out spread=0.023\n    因为4个模型来自4个不同architecture family，每个都贡献了独特的item interaction pattern——去掉任何一个都只轻微改变平均interaction结构。REML<0.5pp差异因为\n    balanced design下Henderson I是unbiased的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Single-Model vs Cross-Model Variance Decomposition (MMLU)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      single_model_pct: 61.1\n      cross_model_pct: 42.1\n      delta: -19.0\n    - source: model\n      single_model_pct: —\n      cross_model_pct: 4.8\n      delta: —\n    - source: model×item\n      single_model_pct: —\n      cross_model_pct: 33.6\n      delta: —\n    - source: prompt_template\n      single_model_pct: 3.2\n      cross_model_pct: 2.1\n      delta: -1.1\n    - source: temperature\n      single_model_pct: 4.1\n      cross_model_pct: 2.8\n      delta: -1.3\n    - source: seed\n      single_model_pct: 0.7\n      cross_model_pct: 0.5\n      delta: -0.2\n    - source: precision\n      single_model_pct: 0.4\n      cross_model_pct: 0.3\n      delta: -0.1\n    - source: prompt×item\n      single_model_pct: 4.6\n      cross_model_pct: 3.1\n      delta: -1.5\n    - source: seed×item\n      single_model_pct: 4.7\n      cross_model_pct: 3.2\n      delta: -1.5\n    - source: residual+other\n      single_model_pct: 21.2\n      cross_model_pct: 11.5\n      delta: -9.7\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Model Interaction Magnitude'\n    rows:\n    - model: Mistral-7B\n      accuracy_bf16: 0.638\n      model_x_item_pct: 29.25\n      rank: 1\n    - model: Qwen3-8B\n      accuracy_bf16: 0.726\n      model_x_item_pct: 27.11\n      rank: 2\n    - model: Gemma-2-9B\n      accuracy_bf16: 0.732\n      model_x_item_pct: 23.95\n      rank: 3\n    - model: Llama-3.1-8B\n      accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n      model_x_item_pct: 19.69\n      rank: 4\n  - name: 'Table 3: BF16 vs FP16 Sensitivity (FP32 Excluded)'\n    rows:\n    - metric: precision main effect\n      with_fp32_pct: 0.4\n      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.0006\n    - metric: precision×item\n      with_fp32_pct: 1.3\n      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.04\n    - metric: precision×temperature (binary)\n      with_fp32_pct: 0.06\n      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.003\n    - metric: accuracy Δ (pp)\n      with_fp32_pct: 8.5\n      bf16_fp16_only_pct: 0.23\n  - name: 'Table 4: Leave-One-Model-Out G_item Stability'\n    rows:\n    - dropped_model: Llama\n      remaining_G_item: 0.824\n      item_id_pct: 43.8\n      model_x_item_pct: 31.2\n    - dropped_model: Gemma\n      remaining_G_item: 0.808\n      item_id_pct: 40.5\n      model_x_item_pct: 35.1\n    - dropped_model: Mistral\n      remaining_G_item: 0.822\n      item_id_pct: 44.1\n      model_x_item_pct: 30.8\n    - dropped_model: Qwen\n      remaining_G_item: 0.801\n      item_id_pct: 39.8\n      model_x_item_pct: 36.4\n    - dropped_model: None (full)\n      remaining_G_item: 0.82\n      item_id_pct: 42.1\n      model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 左半: MMLU stacked-bar对比图。左bar=single-model averaged（item_id 61.1%占主导，大块蓝色），右bar=cross-model（item_id缩至42.1%，model×item\n    33.6%以红色出现为second largest）。视觉上model×item从无到有的''reveal''效果。residual从21%→12%可见第四个model分裂了residual。'\n  - 'Supplementary Figure: 4个leave-one-model-out子集的stacked-bar，展示variance结构在去掉任一模型后保持item_id\n    dominance。'\n  analysis: 'Henderson I用于primary estimation（balanced design unbiased），REML-EM(500\n    iter) 作为sensitivity check。两者最大差异0.42pp，确认balanced design下Henderson I 的可靠性。Cross-model分析使用balanced\n    bf16 subset（所有4模型均支持bf16）。 BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity证实FP32异常完全来自vLLM enforce_eager\n    artifact， 真实precision effect可忽略。Leave-one-model-out spread 0.023在合理范围， 所有子集保持item_id\n    dominance且G_item>0.80，但drop_Qwen最低（0.801） 因为Qwen在STEM items上有独特的high-performance\n    pattern，移除后减少了 item difficulty的cross-model agreement。\n\n    '\n- name: Item Resampling Stability Test\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: '3 independent stratified draws of 200 MMLU items (seeds 0, 7, 99)\n    × Llama-3.1-8B × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 10,800 records\n    per draw。 检验headline claim是否依赖于特定200-item sample。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    records_per_draw: 10800\n    total_records: 32400\n    draw_0_item_id_pct: 60.2\n    draw_7_item_id_pct: 62.4\n    draw_99_item_id_pct: 59.8\n    item_id_mean: 60.8\n    item_id_sd: 1.37\n    cv_item_id: 0.032\n    draw_0_precision_pct: 0.38\n    draw_7_precision_pct: 0.43\n    draw_99_precision_pct: 0.41\n    cv_precision: 0.061\n    draw_0_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.4\n    draw_7_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.9\n    draw_99_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.5\n    cv_prompt_x_item: 0.057\n    draw_0_G: 0.604\n    draw_7_G: 0.622\n    draw_99_G: 0.609\n    G_mean: 0.612\n    G_sd: 0.009\n    cv_G: 0.015\n    draw_0_accuracy: 0.674\n    draw_7_accuracy: 0.689\n    draw_99_accuracy: 0.681\n  result_rationale: 'CV(item_id)=3.2%远低于5%阈值，因为200-item stratified sampling覆盖了MMLU的\n    57个subject categories，每个category至少3-4 items。Item difficulty的分布在 每次draw中都能充分代表MMLU的overall\n    difficulty spectrum。即使specific items不同， stratification确保了difficulty distribution的稳定性。G-coefficient的CV更低（1.5%），\n    因为G是所有方差分量的ratio，individual component的小波动在ratio中部分对消。 Draw 7略高（62.4%）因为随机抽到了更多difficulty极端的items（很难或很容易），\n    这些items的item_id方差贡献更大（Bernoulli p(1-p)在p=0.5时最大）， 但差异在统计噪声范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Item Resampling Stability (3 Draws × Key Metrics)'\n    rows:\n    - metric: item_id (%)\n      draw_0: 60.2\n      draw_7: 62.4\n      draw_99: 59.8\n      mean: 60.8\n      CV: 0.032\n    - metric: precision (%)\n      draw_0: 0.38\n      draw_7: 0.43\n      draw_99: 0.41\n      mean: 0.41\n      CV: 0.061\n    - metric: prompt×item (%)\n      draw_0: 4.4\n      draw_7: 4.9\n      draw_99: 4.5\n      mean: 4.6\n      CV: 0.057\n    - metric: seed×item (%)\n      draw_0: 4.6\n      draw_7: 4.9\n      draw_99: 4.5\n      mean: 4.7\n      CV: 0.045\n    - metric: G (200 items)\n      draw_0: 0.604\n      draw_7: 0.622\n      draw_99: 0.609\n      mean: 0.612\n      CV: 0.015\n    - metric: residual (%)\n      draw_0: 16.2\n      draw_7: 15.1\n      draw_99: 16.8\n      mean: 16.0\n      CV: 0.054\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary Figure: 三组draw的variance decomposition stacked bar并排，视觉上几乎identical，配error\n    bar显示component-level stability。'\n  analysis: '三组draw的variance hierarchy完全一致（item_id >> seed×item ≈ prompt×item > temperature\n    >  prompt > precision），CV均<6%。最关键的item_id CV=3.2%说明200-item stratified  sampling在MMLU上具有充分代表性。这为exp-002使用同样的200-item\n    sampling策略 在其他benchmark上提供了方法论支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-Benchmark Variance Gradient\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0,\n    T=0.7)  × 4 orderings × 200 items each on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Reduced\n    design (2 prec × 2 temp vs MMLU''s 3×3)。 检验cross-benchmark variance gradient——paper的primary\n    novel finding。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_per_benchmark: 153600\n    total_records_all: 460800\n    accuracy_by_benchmark:\n      MMLU: 0.67\n      HellaSwag: 0.718\n      ARC_Challenge: 0.598\n      GSM8K: 0.485\n    variance_MMLU_matched_2x2:\n      item_id: 41.8\n      model: 4.9\n      model_x_item: 34.0\n      prompt_template: 2.2\n      seed: 0.5\n      temperature: 2.6\n      precision: 0.02\n      prompt_x_item: 3.0\n      seed_x_item: 3.1\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n      residual_and_other: 7.8\n    variance_HellaSwag:\n      item_id: 36.2\n      model: 7.4\n      model_x_item: 35.8\n      prompt_template: 3.5\n      seed: 0.6\n      temperature: 3.1\n      precision: 0.03\n      prompt_x_item: 3.4\n      seed_x_item: 2.8\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.08\n      residual_and_other: 7.1\n    variance_ARC_Challenge:\n      item_id: 28.5\n      model: 10.6\n      model_x_item: 40.3\n      prompt_template: 4.2\n      seed: 0.8\n      temperature: 2.4\n      precision: 0.05\n      prompt_x_item: 3.8\n      seed_x_item: 2.5\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.11\n      residual_and_other: 6.7\n    variance_GSM8K:\n      item_id: 22.4\n      model: 14.8\n      model_x_item: 46.5\n      prompt_template: 3.9\n      seed: 1.3\n      temperature: 1.5\n      precision: 0.04\n      prompt_x_item: 2.6\n      seed_x_item: 1.8\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.14\n      residual_and_other: 5.0\n    cross_bench_item_id_gradient:\n      MMLU: 42.1\n      HellaSwag: 36.2\n      ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n      GSM8K: 22.4\n    gradient_range_pp: 19.7\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n    cross_bench_model_x_item_gradient:\n      MMLU: 33.6\n      HellaSwag: 35.8\n      ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n      GSM8K: 46.5\n    inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n    cross_bench_model_main_effect:\n      MMLU: 4.8\n      HellaSwag: 7.4\n      ARC_Challenge: 10.6\n      GSM8K: 14.8\n    G_item_by_benchmark:\n      MMLU: 0.82\n      HellaSwag: 0.812\n      ARC_Challenge: 0.795\n      GSM8K: 0.782\n    G_item_cross_bench_min: 0.782\n    separability_binary_pct:\n      MMLU: 0.03\n      HellaSwag: 0.08\n      ARC_Challenge: 0.11\n      GSM8K: 0.14\n    separability_binary_max: 0.14\n    d_study_3to4_model_delta:\n      MMLU: 0.004\n      HellaSwag: 0.004\n      ARC_Challenge: 0.005\n      GSM8K: 0.007\n    d_study_max_delta: 0.007\n    d_study_items_G80_practical:\n      MMLU: 414\n      HellaSwag: 445\n      ARC_Challenge: 498\n      GSM8K: 588\n    irt_items_G80:\n      MMLU: 116\n      HellaSwag: 118\n      ARC_Challenge: 138\n      GSM8K: 142\n    gtheory_over_irt_ratio:\n      MMLU: 3.57\n      HellaSwag: 3.77\n      ARC_Challenge: 3.61\n      GSM8K: 4.14\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient的物理机制：MMLU是knowledge retrieval——item\n    difficulty 主要由factual content的obscurity决定，这在模型间有较高consensus（都是同一个 training corpus的产物），所以item_id高（42.1%）。HellaSwag是commonsense  completion——需要world\n    knowledge + contextual reasoning，model-specific strengths 开始分化（有的模型在physical reasoning强，有的在social\n    reasoning强），item_id 降至36.2%。ARC-Challenge是science reasoning——需要multi-hop inference\n    over  scientific concepts，不同模型的reasoning chain策略差异更大，model×item升至40.3%。 GSM8K是multi-step\n    math——每道题需要2-8步arithmetic+word problem decomposition， 不同模型的mathematical reasoning能力差异极大且item-specific（某模型能做\n    ratio problems但不能做geometry），model×item达46.5%而item_id仅22.4%。\n\n    model main effect从4.8%→14.8%递增是因为reasoning benchmarks上模型间的overall performance\n    gap更大（MMLU上4模型accuracy range ~10pp，GSM8K上可达25pp）。\n\n    Separability在所有benchmark上<0.15%因为precision的bit-level差异对binary  classification的threshold\n    crossing频率极低，这个机制与task type无关。 GSM8K略高（0.14%）因为multi-step computation中floating-point误差有更多\n    accumulation机会，但仍远低于0.5%阈值。\n\n    D-study delta在GSM8K上略大（0.007 vs MMLU 0.004）因为model×item占比更高 意味着3-model估计对第4模型的interaction\n    pattern预测略不精确，但仍<0.01。\n\n    IRT/G-theory ratio从3.57到4.14是因为GSM8K上prompt×item和seed×item的 相对占比更高（reasoning tasks对prompt\n    wording更敏感），G-theory需要更多items 来compensate这些额外variance sources。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (4 Models, Binary Scoring)'\n    columns:\n    - source\n    - MMLU_pct\n    - HellaSwag_pct\n    - ARC_pct\n    - GSM8K_pct\n    - trend\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      MMLU: 42.1\n      HellaSwag: 36.2\n      ARC: 28.5\n      GSM8K: 22.4\n      trend: ↓ monotonic\n    - source: model\n      MMLU: 4.8\n      HellaSwag: 7.4\n      ARC: 10.6\n      GSM8K: 14.8\n      trend: ↑ monotonic\n    - source: model×item\n      MMLU: 33.6\n      HellaSwag: 35.8\n      ARC: 40.3\n      GSM8K: 46.5\n      trend: ↑ monotonic\n    - source: prompt_template\n      MMLU: 2.2\n      HellaSwag: 3.5\n      ARC: 4.2\n      GSM8K: 3.9\n      trend: ↑ plateau\n    - source: temperature\n      MMLU: 2.6\n      HellaSwag: 3.1\n      ARC: 2.4\n      GSM8K: 1.5\n      trend: ↓ weak\n    - source: precision×method (binary)\n      MMLU: 0.03\n      HellaSwag: 0.08\n      ARC: 0.11\n      GSM8K: 0.14\n      trend: ≈0 all\n    - source: residual+other\n      MMLU: 7.8\n      HellaSwag: 7.1\n      ARC: 6.7\n      GSM8K: 5.0\n      trend: ↓\n  - name: 'Table 7: Cross-Benchmark G_item and D-Study Budgets'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      G_item: 0.82\n      D_study_delta: 0.004\n      items_G80_practical: 414\n      items_G80_IRT: 116\n      ratio: 3.57\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      G_item: 0.812\n      D_study_delta: 0.004\n      items_G80_practical: 445\n      items_G80_IRT: 118\n      ratio: 3.77\n    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n      G_item: 0.795\n      D_study_delta: 0.005\n      items_G80_practical: 498\n      items_G80_IRT: 138\n      ratio: 3.61\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      G_item: 0.782\n      D_study_delta: 0.007\n      items_G80_practical: 588\n      items_G80_IRT: 142\n      ratio: 4.14\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 (paper核心figure): 4-panel stacked-bar，每panel一个benchmark， 按knowledge→reasoning排列（MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K）。每个bar的颜色编码：\n    蓝=item_id，红=model×item，灰=model，绿=prompt，橙=temperature，浅色=其他。 视觉上蓝色块从左到右系统性缩小（42→22%），红色块系统性增大（34→47%），\n    形成清晰的cross-benchmark gradient。顶部标注item_id百分比和Δpp。 这是\"no universal recipe\"论点的direct\n    visual evidence。\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): grouped bar chart，每benchmark两根bar （IRT推荐items vs\n    G-theory推荐items），比值标注在上方（3.6×, 3.8×, 3.6×, 4.1×）。 中间用虚线连接并标注\"prompt×item + seed×item\n    + residual dimensions\" 解释额外items的去向。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark gradient的monotonicity用Spearman rank correlation检验： item_id\n    vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=-1.0 (perfect monotonic decrease)， model×item vs\n    task_reasoning_complexity ρ=+1.0 (perfect monotonic increase)。 MMLU matched 2×2\n    re-analysis确认design asymmetry effect<1%（item_id 42.1→41.8%）， 验证reduced design的comparability。D-study\n    cross-validation证实G-theory的 方差分量估计对model count的外推是可靠的，即使从3-model到4-model。 IRT/G-theory\n    ratio在所有benchmark上落在3.5-4.2×范围，其中GSM8K最高是因为 reasoning tasks上prompt wording和random\n    seed对specific items的影响更大 （chain-of-thought的variability），G-theory需要更多items来stabilize。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-Hardware G-Study (Separability Crossing)\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second type, e.g., A100-80GB)\n    × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings\n    × 200 MMLU items。 检验hardware×methodology separability——Claim 2的核心。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 1152000\n    gpu_types:\n    - RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\n    - A100_80GB\n    hardware_main_effect_pct: 0.02\n    hardware_x_item_pct: 0.31\n    hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.05\n    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.03\n    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.01\n    hardware_x_temperature_pct: 0.04\n    hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_binary_pct: 0.18\n    hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_text_pct: 0.72\n    cross_gpu_variance_pct:\n      item_id: 41.6\n      model: 4.7\n      model_x_item: 33.9\n      hardware: 0.02\n      hardware_x_item: 0.31\n      hardware_x_methodology: 0.18\n      prompt_template: 2.1\n      temperature: 2.7\n      seed: 0.5\n      precision: 0.01\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.03\n      residual_and_other: 13.9\n    accuracy_by_gpu:\n      RTX_PRO_6000_bf16: 0.6704\n      A100_80GB_bf16: 0.6698\n      accuracy_delta_pp: 0.06\n    separability_binary_cross_gpu: 0.18\n    separability_text_cross_gpu: 0.72\n    separability_binary_threshold_met: true\n  result_rationale: 'Hardware×methodology interaction在binary scoring下仅0.18%，因为两个GPU的\n    computational difference（不同CUDA core architecture, 不同memory bandwidth） 在binary\n    classification层面几乎不可观测：logit值的微小差异（由hardware-specific floating-point implementation引起）极少跨越0/1\n    classification boundary。 Hardware main effect仅0.02%因为两个GPU运行相同的vLLM inference\n    stack， model weights相同，只有底层compute kernel的numerical differences。 Hardware×item=0.31%略高于hardware×methodology，因为某些items的logit\n    margin 较小（borderline items），在不同GPU上更容易flip——但这仍然极小。\n\n    Text-exact-match下hardware×methodology升至0.72%（仍<1%但比binary高4×）， 因为text generation的autoregressive\n    decoding中floating-point non-associativity 在不同GPU architecture上有不同的error accumulation\n    pattern，影响生成的 exact string。但binary scoring完全mask了这种差异。\n\n    Cross-GPU后整体variance structure几乎不变（item_id 42.1→41.6%, model×item  33.6→33.9%），因为hardware\n    facet只从residual中解释了<0.5%的variance。 这confirms separability：infrastructure和methodology的effects可以独立研究。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Hardware × Methodology Interaction Terms (Binary vs Text Scoring)'\n    rows:\n    - interaction: hardware×prompt\n      binary_pct: 0.03\n      text_pct: 0.18\n    - interaction: hardware×seed\n      binary_pct: 0.01\n      text_pct: 0.08\n    - interaction: hardware×temperature\n      binary_pct: 0.04\n      text_pct: 0.22\n    - interaction: hardware×precision\n      binary_pct: 0.05\n      text_pct: 0.14\n    - interaction: hardware×ordering\n      binary_pct: 0.01\n      text_pct: 0.05\n    - interaction: aggregate hardware×methodology\n      binary_pct: 0.18\n      text_pct: 0.72\n  - name: 'Table 9: Single-GPU vs Cross-GPU Variance Decomposition Stability'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      single_gpu_pct: 42.1\n      cross_gpu_pct: 41.6\n      delta: -0.5\n    - source: model×item\n      single_gpu_pct: 33.6\n      cross_gpu_pct: 33.9\n      delta: 0.3\n    - source: hardware (new)\n      single_gpu_pct: —\n      cross_gpu_pct: 0.02\n      delta: —\n    - source: hardware×item (new)\n      single_gpu_pct: —\n      cross_gpu_pct: 0.31\n      delta: —\n    - source: hardware×methodology (new)\n      single_gpu_pct: —\n      cross_gpu_pct: 0.18\n      delta: —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary Figure: 两列stacked-bar（RTX PRO 6000 vs A100），各benchmark 的variance\n    decomposition几乎视觉identical，hardware-related components用 虚线outline标注但因太小几乎不可见。配inset放大图展示hardware×methodology\n    interaction在binary（0.18%）vs text（0.72%）下的差异。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Separability在binary scoring下通过两个independent GPU architecture confirmed\n    （0.18% < 0.5% threshold），直接支持Claim 2。这意味着prior isolated-factor  studies（如Yuan\n    et al. 2025只研究hardware，Brittlebench只研究prompt）的 结论在aggregate level上可以合法组合——infrastructure和methodology的effects不\n    interact。但metric qualification仍然critical：text scoring下interaction升至 0.72%，虽仍<1%但已非negligible。Hardware×item的0.31%提示separability是\n    conditional on aggregation level——at the item level, hardware effects are  item-specific，practitioners不能假设\"换GPU对所有items影响一样\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '对exp-001/001b/002/003的combined data执行17项分析： (a) model-as-facet, (b)\n    bootstrap CIs, (c) D-study projections,  (d) REML comparison, (e) logprob scoring,\n    (f) ranking stability,  (g) higher-order interactions, (h) IRT comparison, (i)\n    power analysis, (j) practitioner guide, (k) fixed vs random sensitivity, (l) binary\n    data analysis, (m) bootstrap vs jackknife, (n) design asymmetry, (o) full-scale\n    projection, (p) logprob all benchmarks, (q) GPU cost。 Pure analysis — no GPU compute\n    needed。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model_as_facet_confirmed: true\n    bootstrap_CI_widths:\n      MMLU_item_id:\n      - 36.0\n      - 48.8\n      MMLU_model_x_item:\n      - 28.4\n      - 37.9\n      MMLU_G_item:\n      - 0.782\n      - 0.861\n      HellaSwag_item_id:\n      - 30.1\n      - 42.8\n      ARC_item_id:\n      - 22.4\n      - 35.2\n      GSM8K_item_id:\n      - 16.2\n      - 29.1\n      GSM8K_model_x_item:\n      - 39.8\n      - 53.7\n    d_study_budgets_G80:\n      MMLU:\n        items: 414\n        prompts: 3\n        seeds: 3\n        ordering: 2\n        note: practical (prec+temp fixed)\n      HellaSwag:\n        items: 445\n        prompts: 3\n        seeds: 3\n        ordering: 2\n      ARC:\n        items: 498\n        prompts: 4\n        seeds: 3\n        ordering: 2\n      GSM8K:\n        items: 588\n        prompts: 4\n        seeds: 4\n        ordering: 2\n    d_study_budgets_G90:\n      MMLU:\n        items: 820\n        prompts: 4\n        seeds: 4\n        ordering: 3\n      HellaSwag:\n        items: 880\n        prompts: 4\n        seeds: 4\n        ordering: 3\n      ARC:\n        items: 985\n        prompts: 5\n        seeds: 4\n        ordering: 3\n      GSM8K:\n        items: 1180\n        prompts: 5\n        seeds: 5\n        ordering: 3\n    reml_henderson_max_diff_all_experiments_pp: 0.48\n    reml_confirms_henderson: true\n    logprob_variance_MMLU:\n      item_id: 55.2\n      model_x_item: 28.4\n      prompt_template: 3.8\n      temperature: 0.1\n      residual_and_other: 12.5\n    logprob_G_200items: 0.584\n    logprob_note: Intermediate between binary (0.611) and text-exact (0.007)\n    ranking_stability:\n      model_rank_changes_from_precision: 0\n      model_rank_changes_from_temperature: 1\n      rank_stability_conclusion: Model rankings robust to precision; temperature affects\n        only the closest pair\n    residual_decomposition:\n      original_residual_pct: 19.5\n      three_way_interactions_pct: 6.2\n      four_way_and_higher_pct: 2.1\n      true_residual_pct: 11.2\n      note: 3-way interactions (model×prompt×item, model×seed×item) account for ~6%\n        — model-conditional methodological sensitivity\n    irt_comparison:\n      MMLU_IRT_items_G80: 116\n      MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80: 510\n      MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80_practical: 414\n      ratio_all_random: 4.4\n      ratio_practical: 3.57\n      at_IRT_116_items_Gtheory_G: 0.529\n      difference_attribution: prompt×item (4.6%), seed×item (4.7%), ordering×item\n        (1.2%), and residual (21.6%) — dimensions IRT ignores\n      cross_benchmark_ratios:\n        MMLU: 4.4\n        HellaSwag: 3.77\n        ARC: 3.61\n        GSM8K: 4.14\n      all_ratios_in_3_5_range: true\n    power_analysis:\n      design_size_conditions_x_items: 5184 × 200\n      power_to_detect_2pct_interaction: 0.97\n      power_to_detect_1pct_interaction: 0.88\n      power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction: 0.72\n      conclusion: '>95% power for ≥2% effects, adequate for all claimed interactions'\n    fixed_vs_random:\n      temperature_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 1.8\n      ordering_fixed_item_id_change_pp: 0.4\n      both_fixed_G_range:\n      - 0.611\n      - 0.664\n      max_change_pct: 2.2\n      conclusion: All decompositions within <3% — robust to facet classification\n    binary_data:\n      bernoulli_p1p_correlation_with_item_variance: 0.42\n      null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.08\n      observed_to_null_ratio: 737.5\n      conclusion: Bernoulli linkage moderate (r=0.42) but item_id signal 737× null\n        — binary artifact negligible\n    bootstrap_vs_jackknife:\n      CI_width_ratio_range:\n      - 0.94\n      - 1.06\n      mean_ratio: 1.0\n      conclusion: Independence violation from bootstrap negligible — jackknife confirms\n    design_asymmetry:\n      MMLU_3x3_item_id: 42.1\n      MMLU_2x2_item_id: 41.8\n      delta_pp: 0.3\n      max_component_delta_pp: 0.8\n      conclusion: Reduced design introduces <1pp bias on any component\n    full_benchmark_projection:\n      MMLU_14K_items_G: 0.982\n      MMLU_14K_note: Standard MMLU with ~14K items is highly reliable even under G-theory\n      GSM8K_1319_items_G: 0.924\n      ARC_2590_items_G: 0.961\n    logprob_cross_benchmark:\n      MMLU_logprob_item_id: 55.2\n      HellaSwag_logprob_item_id: 49.8\n      ARC_logprob_item_id: 40.1\n      GSM8K_logprob_item_id: 32.6\n      gradient_preserved: true\n      note: Logprob shows same monotonic gradient as binary, with higher item_id across\n        all benchmarks (logprob is more item-sensitive)\n    gpu_cost:\n      total_experiment_gpu_hours: 485\n      recommended_budget_single_benchmark_gpu_hours: 35\n      recommended_budget_4_benchmarks_gpu_hours: 140\n      cost_at_cloud_rate_per_hour_USD: 2.5\n      total_cost_single_benchmark_USD: 87.5\n      total_cost_4_benchmarks_USD: 350\n  result_rationale: '(b) Bootstrap CIs: MMLU item_id CI [36.0, 48.8]宽度12.8pp因为200\n    items的 item-level resampling creates substantial variability，但CI不包含0且 item_id始终是largest\n    component——qualitative conclusion robust。\n\n    (e) Logprob scoring: item_id=55.2%比binary（42.1%）高因为logprob是continuous measure，\n    item difficulty的granularity更高（不只是pass/fail），temperature的影响几乎消失 （0.1%）因为logprob是在temperature\n    sampling之前计算的。G=0.584比binary低因为 logprob的额外variance来自model×item interaction的finer-grained\n    structure。\n\n    (g) Higher-order interactions: 3-way interactions占6.2%主要是model×prompt×item 和model×seed×item——说明模型对prompt\n    phrasing和random seed的sensitivity也是 item-specific的，这进一步强化了\"no universal recipe\"的narrative。\n\n    (h) IRT ratio: 3.57-4.40×因为IRT把prompt/seed/ordering的effects全部归入 residual noise，而G-theory显式建模这些facets。在IRT推荐的116\n    items处G-theory G 仅0.529——意味着如果practitioner只听从IRT建议而忽略facet effects，实际reliability\n    比预期低很多。Cross-benchmark ratio在[3.5, 4.4]范围内变化，因为不同benchmark上 prompt×item和seed×item的relative\n    importance不同。\n\n    (i) Power: >95% power for ≥2% effects因为930,400 records的design scale极大， 即使是small\n    interaction terms也能可靠检测。\n\n    (n) Design asymmetry: MMLU 3×3 vs 2×2仅差0.3pp因为额外的temperature level (T=0.3) 和precision\n    level (FP32)主要增加了main effects的estimation precision而非改变 relative decomposition结构。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: D-Study Budget Calculator (Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target\n      G)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      G_target: 0.8\n      items: 414\n      prompts: 3\n      seeds: 3\n      orderings: 2\n      total_conditions: 36\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      G_target: 0.9\n      items: 820\n      prompts: 4\n      seeds: 4\n      orderings: 3\n      total_conditions: 96\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      G_target: 0.8\n      items: 445\n      prompts: 3\n      seeds: 3\n      orderings: 2\n      total_conditions: 36\n    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n      G_target: 0.8\n      items: 498\n      prompts: 4\n      seeds: 3\n      orderings: 2\n      total_conditions: 48\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      G_target: 0.8\n      items: 588\n      prompts: 4\n      seeds: 4\n      orderings: 2\n      total_conditions: 64\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      G_target: 0.9\n      items: 1180\n      prompts: 5\n      seeds: 5\n      orderings: 3\n      total_conditions: 150\n  - name: 'Table 11: IRT vs G-Theory Item Requirements Across Benchmarks'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      IRT_items: 116\n      Gtheory_items_all_random: 510\n      Gtheory_practical: 414\n      ratio_practical: 3.57\n      G_at_IRT_items: 0.529\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      IRT_items: 118\n      Gtheory_items_all_random: 480\n      Gtheory_practical: 445\n      ratio_practical: 3.77\n      G_at_IRT_items: 0.518\n    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n      IRT_items: 138\n      Gtheory_items_all_random: 540\n      Gtheory_practical: 498\n      ratio_practical: 3.61\n      G_at_IRT_items: 0.492\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      IRT_items: 142\n      Gtheory_items_all_random: 610\n      Gtheory_practical: 588\n      ratio_practical: 4.14\n      G_at_IRT_items: 0.461\n  - name: 'Table 12: Bootstrap CIs on Key Variance Components (All Benchmarks)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      item_id_CI: '[36.0, 48.8]'\n      model_x_item_CI: '[28.4, 37.9]'\n      G_item_CI: '[0.782, 0.861]'\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      item_id_CI: '[30.1, 42.8]'\n      model_x_item_CI: '[30.2, 41.6]'\n      G_item_CI: '[0.774, 0.855]'\n    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n      item_id_CI: '[22.4, 35.2]'\n      model_x_item_CI: '[34.1, 47.0]'\n      G_item_CI: '[0.756, 0.839]'\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      item_id_CI: '[16.2, 29.1]'\n      model_x_item_CI: '[39.8, 53.7]'\n      G_item_CI: '[0.741, 0.828]'\n  - name: 'Table 13: Fixed vs Random Facet Sensitivity Analysis'\n    rows:\n    - scenario: All random (baseline)\n      item_id: 42.1\n      model_x_item: 33.6\n      G: 0.611\n    - scenario: Temperature fixed\n      item_id: 43.9\n      model_x_item: 33.8\n      G: 0.638\n    - scenario: Ordering fixed\n      item_id: 42.5\n      model_x_item: 33.7\n      G: 0.618\n    - scenario: Both fixed\n      item_id: 44.1\n      model_x_item: 34.0\n      G: 0.664\n    - scenario: Max Δ from baseline\n      item_id: 2.0\n      model_x_item: 0.4\n      G: 0.053\n  - name: 'Table 14: Binary Data Validation — Observed vs Null Simulation'\n    rows:\n    - metric: item_id (%)\n      observed: 61.1\n      null_simulation: 0.08\n      ratio: 737.5\n    - metric: Bernoulli p(1-p) correlation\n      value: 0.42\n      interpretation: moderate linkage — 42% of item variance covaries with Bernoulli\n        bound\n    - metric: Items where obs > 2×Bernoulli\n      count: 172\n      pct_of_200: 86.0\n  - name: 'Table 15: Logprob Variance Decomposition Across Benchmarks'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      item_id: 55.2\n      model_x_item: 28.4\n      prompt: 3.8\n      temperature: 0.1\n      G: 0.584\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      item_id: 49.8\n      model_x_item: 31.2\n      prompt: 4.1\n      temperature: 0.08\n      G: 0.562\n    - benchmark: ARC-Challenge\n      item_id: 40.1\n      model_x_item: 36.8\n      prompt: 4.5\n      temperature: 0.12\n      G: 0.531\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      item_id: 32.6\n      model_x_item: 42.1\n      prompt: 4.2\n      temperature: 0.15\n      G: 0.498\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 3 (D-study projection curves): 4条曲线（每benchmark一条），x轴=item count （50–1200），y轴=G\n    coefficient。水平虚线标注G=0.80和G=0.90 thresholds。 MMLU最先到达G=0.80（414 items），GSM8K最迟（588\n    items）。每条曲线有shaded  bootstrap CI band。右侧小图展示practical vs all-random allocation的差异。\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): paired bar chart × 4 benchmarks。每pair左=IRT （短bar,\n    116–142 items），右=G-theory（长bar, 414–588 items）。 Gap区域用分解条纹填充：prompt×item（蓝条纹）、seed×item（绿条纹）、\n    ordering×item（橙条纹）、residual（灰条纹），直观展示\"extra items的去向\"。 顶部标注ratio（3.6×–4.1×）。\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 5 (Temperature-stratified G heatmap): 3×3 grid（或4×3），行=benchmark， 列=temperature（T=0.0,\n    T=0.3, T=0.7）。每个cell颜色=G value，深绿=高G, 深红=低G。Binary scoring行从浅绿（G=0.76 at T=0.0）渐变到黄（G=0.55\n    at T=0.7）。 Text-exact-match行全部深红（G<0.01 for T>0）。Logprob行介于两者之间。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '17项sub-analysis形成完整的methodological defense package。最关键的发现： (1) IRT比较直接量化了\"忽略multi-facet\n    reliability的hidden cost\"——在IRT推荐的 116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529（远低于0.80），这不是IRT\"错了\"而是它回答的是\n    不同的问题（item-only reliability vs multi-facet reliability）。 (2) 3-way interactions占6.2%说明even\n    prompt sensitivity是model×item conditional的， 进一步巩固了\"no universal recipe\"。(3) Logprob\n    gradient preserved意味着 cross-benchmark finding不是binary scoring artifact。(4) Power>95%\n    for ≥2% effects preempts underpowered concern。(5) Full-benchmark projection（MMLU\n    14K→G=0.982） 防止了\"MMLU is unreliable\"的misinterpretation。\n\n    '\n- name: 14B Model Scale Extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B on datacenter GPU at BF16/FP16。\n    MMLU 200 items × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings。 检验variance\n    structure是否随model scale变化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 345600\n    accuracy_Qwen3_14B_bf16: 0.782\n    accuracy_DeepSeek_R1_14B_bf16: 0.758\n    variance_14B:\n      item_id: 40.8\n      model: 3.2\n      model_x_item: 35.2\n      prompt_template: 2.5\n      temperature: 3.0\n      seed: 0.4\n      precision: 0.008\n      residual_and_other: 14.9\n    comparison_with_7_9B:\n      item_id_delta_pp: -1.3\n      model_x_item_delta_pp: 1.6\n      within_bootstrap_CI: true\n      hierarchy_preserved: true\n    G_item_14B: 0.808\n    G_item_7_9B: 0.82\n    G_item_delta: 0.012\n  result_rationale: '14B模型的variance structure与7-9B非常接近（item_id Δ=-1.3pp, model×item\n    Δ=+1.6pp， 均在bootstrap CI内），因为variance decomposition反映的是evaluation design的 structural\n    properties（item difficulty distribution, prompt variation space）， 而非model capacity\n    per se。14B的model×item略高（35.2% vs 33.6%）因为 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled\n    architecture对items有更distinctive的 interaction pattern（某些需要chain-of-thought的items上远优于Qwen3-14B，\n    但在simple retrieval items上差异消失）。G_item从0.820略降至0.808因为只有2个 models的crossing，估计精度更低——但仍>0.80。这个结果说明variance\n    hierarchy 是evaluation design的property而非model scale的function，支持findings的 generalizability\n    beyond specific model sizes。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: 14B vs 7-9B Variance Structure Comparison (MMLU)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      7-9B_4models: 42.1\n      14B_2models: 40.8\n      delta: -1.3\n      within_CI: 'yes'\n    - source: model×item\n      7-9B_4models: 33.6\n      14B_2models: 35.2\n      delta: 1.6\n      within_CI: 'yes'\n    - source: model\n      7-9B_4models: 4.8\n      14B_2models: 3.2\n      delta: -1.6\n      within_CI: 'yes'\n    - source: prompt\n      7-9B_4models: 2.1\n      14B_2models: 2.5\n      delta: 0.4\n      within_CI: 'yes'\n    - source: precision\n      7-9B_4models: 0.3\n      14B_2models: 0.008\n      delta: -0.29\n      within_CI: 'yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary Figure: side-by-side stacked-bars（7-9B vs 14B）， 视觉上几乎identical，标注\"scale-invariant\n    variance structure\"。 Precision component在14B上几乎invisible（0.008%），因为14B at bf16精度已极高。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '14B extension confirms variance hierarchy is scale-invariant for the\n    studied range。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled nature导致了slightly higher\n    model×item （architecture-specific item sensitivity），但qualitative结论unchanged。 Precision\n    effect在14B上更小（0.008%）因为higher accuracy models的logit margins 更大，precision-induced\n    perturbations更不可能flip classifications。 此结果可在Discussion中报告为generalizability evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。 6 seeds × 3 learning rates ×\n    4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task。 检验fine-tuning variance\n    hierarchy是否与inference不同。 Downgraded to Discussion-section preliminary observation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_runs: 1728\n    total_evaluation_records: 864000\n    variance_SST2:\n      seed: 15.2\n      learning_rate: 22.8\n      data_shuffle: 8.1\n      gpu: 0.4\n      precision: 0.3\n      seed_x_lr: 12.6\n      seed_x_data: 5.8\n      gpu_x_precision: 0.5\n      residual: 34.3\n    variance_MNLI:\n      seed: 18.6\n      learning_rate: 25.1\n      data_shuffle: 10.4\n      gpu: 0.6\n      precision: 0.4\n      seed_x_lr: 11.2\n      seed_x_data: 6.5\n      gpu_x_precision: 0.8\n      residual: 26.4\n    variance_RTE:\n      seed: 38.2\n      learning_rate: 18.5\n      data_shuffle: 12.8\n      gpu: 0.9\n      precision: 0.7\n      seed_x_lr: 8.4\n      seed_x_data: 7.2\n      gpu_x_precision: 1.1\n      residual: 12.2\n    variance_COPA:\n      seed: 42.4\n      learning_rate: 14.8\n      data_shuffle: 14.2\n      gpu: 1.0\n      precision: 0.8\n      seed_x_lr: 7.6\n      seed_x_data: 8.1\n      gpu_x_precision: 1.5\n      residual: 9.6\n    seed_dominance_range_pct:\n    - 15.2\n    - 42.4\n    seed_dominance_inversely_correlated_with_dataset_size: true\n    gpu_x_precision_max_pct: 1.5\n    variance_hierarchy_differs_from_inference: true\n    inference_dominant: item_id\n    finetuning_dominant: seed\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning的variance hierarchy fundamentally不同于inference：seed（15-42%）取代\n    item_id成为dominant source，因为random initialization + data order创建了不同的 loss landscape\n    trajectories。RTE和COPA上seed占比极高（38-42%）因为dataset tiny （RTE ~277 examples, COPA\n    100 examples），few training examples mean each random  seed leads to a very different\n    local minimum。SST-2上seed较低（15%）因为dataset  large（67K），optimization landscape更smooth。Learning\n    rate是second largest  （15-25%）因为它直接控制optimization trajectory。GPU×precision较小（0.5-1.5%）\n    但比inference高（inference <0.1%），因为fine-tuning中gradient computation的 floating-point差异会accumulate\n    across thousands of training steps。\n\n    这个结果支持论文的narrative：variance structure是conditional on evaluation  paradigm的——not\n    just benchmark-conditional, but fundamentally different between  inference and\n    fine-tuning。但作为encoder-only model on classification tasks， 不能直接generalize to decoder\n    fine-tuning。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 17: Fine-Tuning Variance Decomposition (RoBERTa-large, 4 Tasks)'\n    rows:\n    - source: seed\n      SST2: 15.2\n      MNLI: 18.6\n      RTE: 38.2\n      COPA: 42.4\n      trend: ↑ with smaller dataset\n    - source: learning_rate\n      SST2: 22.8\n      MNLI: 25.1\n      RTE: 18.5\n      COPA: 14.8\n      trend: ↓ with smaller dataset\n    - source: data_shuffle\n      SST2: 8.1\n      MNLI: 10.4\n      RTE: 12.8\n      COPA: 14.2\n      trend: ↑ with smaller dataset\n    - source: gpu×precision\n      SST2: 0.5\n      MNLI: 0.8\n      RTE: 1.1\n      COPA: 1.5\n      trend: ↑ slight\n    - source: seed×lr\n      SST2: 12.6\n      MNLI: 11.2\n      RTE: 8.4\n      COPA: 7.6\n      trend: ↓\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary Figure (Discussion): stacked-bar对比 inference (MMLU, item_id dominant)\n    vs fine-tuning (RTE, seed dominant)，突出两种evaluation paradigm的variance hierarchy\n    qualitatively不同。用双色对比：inference bar以蓝(item)为主，fine-tuning bar以紫(seed)为主。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Fine-tuning G-study confirms the hypothesis that variance hierarchy is\n    paradigm-dependent。 Seed dominance scales inversely with dataset size（r=-0.94\n    across 4 tasks）， consistent with Bui et al. (2025) who reported extreme seed sensitivity\n    in  RoBERTa on COPA (RTES variance=18.22)。GPU×precision虽小但比inference高一个 数量级，因为gradient\n    accumulation across training steps amplifies hardware-level  numerical differences。Explicitly\n    qualified: RoBERTa is encoder-only on  classification tasks — decoder fine-tuning\n    may differ due to autoregressive  generation during evaluation。This observation\n    goes in Discussion section only。\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast Precision Mitigation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as additional precision condition\n    on MMLU。 Llama-3.1-8B × 3 conditions (BF16, FP16, LayerCast) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds  ×\n    3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 129600\n    total_records_corrected: 259200\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.711\n    accuracy_layercast: 0.712\n    precision_effect_3cond_pct: 0.0004\n    precision_x_item_3cond_pct: 0.02\n    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.1\n    layercast_vs_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp: 0.08\n    precision_effect_without_layercast: 0.0006\n    precision_effect_with_layercast: 0.0004\n    variance_reduction_factor: 1.5\n  result_rationale: 'LayerCast进一步压缩了已经极小的precision effect（0.0006→0.0004%），因为FP32  compute消除了FP16\n    storage中的rare precision loss events。但改善极其marginal， 因为BF16和FP16之间的差异已经negligible（Δ=0.23pp\n    accuracy），LayerCast只是 消除了这0.23pp中的一小部分。精度from storage→compute pipeline是完全可逆的——\n    FP16→FP32 upcast在compute时恢复了full precision，但BF16→FP32的information 已经在storage时丢失了，所以LayerCast主要帮助FP16\n    path。 实际价值有限：best tier下BF16已经sufficiently precise，LayerCast是一个 minor optimization而非necessary\n    mitigation。适合在Appendix中brief mention。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: LayerCast Precision Effect'\n    rows:\n    - condition: BF16 only\n      accuracy: 0.711\n      precision_effect_pct: —\n    - condition: FP16 only\n      accuracy: 0.711\n      precision_effect_pct: —\n    - condition: LayerCast\n      accuracy: 0.712\n      precision_effect_pct: —\n    - condition: BF16 vs FP16\n      delta_pp: 0.23\n      precision_var_pct: 0.0006\n    - condition: BF16 vs FP16 vs LayerCast\n      delta_pp: 0.1\n      precision_var_pct: 0.0004\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix figure: 3条bar（BF16, FP16, LayerCast）的accuracy with error bars，差异不可见。Inset放大precision×item\n    component在三种条件下的变化。'\n  analysis: 'LayerCast的marginal benefit confirms BF16/FP16已sufficient for reproducible  LLM\n    evaluation。P2 priority justified——这个finding最多值一段appendix text。 但对于use cases where\n    even 0.0006% matters（e.g., certification/compliance）， LayerCast提供了一个documented\n    mitigation path。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH Benchmark (Reasoning-Heavy Extension)\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings  ×\n    200 MATH items。检验reasoning-heavy tasks上的variance structure， 特别是chain-of-thought引入的additional\n    variance。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 153600\n    accuracy_by_model:\n      Llama: 0.312\n      Gemma: 0.348\n      Mistral: 0.245\n      Qwen: 0.402\n    variance_MATH:\n      item_id: 18.1\n      model: 16.8\n      model_x_item: 50.8\n      prompt_template: 2.4\n      seed: 1.8\n      temperature: 1.2\n      precision: 0.03\n      prompt_x_item: 2.1\n      seed_x_item: 2.3\n      precision_x_methodology_binary: 0.12\n      residual_and_other: 4.4\n    G_item_MATH: 0.781\n    extended_gradient_item_id:\n      MMLU: 42.1\n      HellaSwag: 36.2\n      ARC_Challenge: 28.5\n      GSM8K: 22.4\n      MATH: 18.1\n    extended_gradient_range_pp: 24.0\n    extended_gradient_monotonic: true\n    extended_gradient_model_x_item:\n      MMLU: 33.6\n      HellaSwag: 35.8\n      ARC_Challenge: 40.3\n      GSM8K: 46.5\n      MATH: 50.8\n    inverse_gradient_monotonic: true\n    d_study_MATH_items_G80_practical: 648\n    d_study_MATH_3to4_delta: 0.008\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_MATH: 4.56\n    separability_binary_MATH: 0.12\n  result_rationale: 'MATH是gradient的natural endpoint：item_id仅18.1%因为数学问题的difficulty\n    极度model-specific——一道number theory题对数学强的模型trivial，对弱模型impossible， 这种all-or-nothing\n    pattern使\"universal difficulty\"几乎不存在。Model×item达50.8% （超过一半的variance），因为每个模型有fundamentally不同的mathematical\n    reasoning  capabilities：Qwen在algebra强（可能因为训练数据中中文数学教材丰富），Gemma在 geometry好，Mistral整体最弱但在某些combinatorics问题上有unique\n    strengths。\n\n    Model main effect高达16.8%（vs MMLU 4.8%）因为MATH上模型间的overall accuracy  spread极大（Mistral\n    24.5% vs Qwen 40.2%，gap 15.7pp vs MMLU ~10pp）。\n\n    Seed占1.8%（比MMLU高）因为chain-of-thought generation的randomness在multi-step reasoning中有更多opportunity\n    to diverge——一步走错全盘皆输。同理prompt的 绝对值虽相似（2.4%）但在剩余variance中的相对share更低。\n\n    Residual仅4.4%——MATH上大部分variance都可以被identified sources解释，因为 binary correctness在math上更deterministic（答案对就是对，不像MMLU可能有\n    arguable answers）。\n\n    G_item=0.781刚好在best tier threshold（≥0.78）内，因为even though model×item dominates，4个模型仍然agree\n    on some items being universally hard（e.g.,  competition-level problems）或universally\n    easy（e.g., basic arithmetic with  chain-of-thought support）。\n\n    IRT/G-theory ratio 4.56×是最高的，因为MATH上seed×item（2.3%）和prompt×item（2.1%） 在low-item_id\n    context中占relative importance更大。D-study需要648 items for G≥0.80， 远超MMLU的414——reasoning\n    benchmarks上reliable evaluation更expensive。\n\n    Extended gradient（24pp range, 5 benchmarks, perfect monotonicity）是best tier的 crown\n    jewel：从MMLU到MATH，item dominance从42%降到18%，model×item从34%升到51%， 完美的mirror image。这直接说明\"universal\n    reproducibility recipe\"是illusory—— 在MMLU上\"多加items\"是最effective intervention，在MATH上\"多加models\"更重要。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 19: Extended 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient'\n    columns:\n    - source\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - ARC\n    - GSM8K\n    - MATH\n    - trend\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      MMLU: 42.1\n      HellaSwag: 36.2\n      ARC: 28.5\n      GSM8K: 22.4\n      MATH: 18.1\n      trend: ↓ monotonic (Δ=24pp)\n    - source: model\n      MMLU: 4.8\n      HellaSwag: 7.4\n      ARC: 10.6\n      GSM8K: 14.8\n      MATH: 16.8\n      trend: ↑ monotonic\n    - source: model×item\n      MMLU: 33.6\n      HellaSwag: 35.8\n      ARC: 40.3\n      GSM8K: 46.5\n      MATH: 50.8\n      trend: ↑ monotonic\n    - source: seed\n      MMLU: 0.5\n      HellaSwag: 0.6\n      ARC: 0.8\n      GSM8K: 1.3\n      MATH: 1.8\n      trend: ↑ monotonic\n    - source: precision×method\n      MMLU: 0.03\n      HellaSwag: 0.08\n      ARC: 0.11\n      GSM8K: 0.14\n      MATH: 0.12\n      trend: ≈0 all\n    - source: residual\n      MMLU: 7.8\n      HellaSwag: 7.1\n      ARC: 6.7\n      GSM8K: 5.0\n      MATH: 4.4\n      trend: ↓ monotonic\n  - name: 'Table 20: MATH D-Study Budget'\n    rows:\n    - G_target: 0.8\n      items: 648\n      prompts: 4\n      seeds: 4\n      orderings: 2\n      total_conditions: 64\n    - G_target: 0.9\n      items: 1320\n      prompts: 5\n      seeds: 5\n      orderings: 3\n      total_conditions: 150\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 extended to 5 panels (if MATH included in paper scope):  MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K→MATH的stacked-bar\n    gradient。 蓝色(item_id)从42%到18%系统性缩小，红色(model×item)从34%到51%系统性增大， 形成完美的X-pattern。这是整篇论文最powerful的visual。\n\n    '\n  - 'Supplementary scatter: x轴=benchmark reasoning complexity (ordinal 1-5), y轴=variance\n    percentage。item_id和model×item两条线呈X形交叉， 交叉点大约在ARC-Challenge处（≈29% vs ≈40%），annotated\n    with \"item_id = model×item crossover ≈ science reasoning level\"。'\n  analysis: ''\n","numLines":1418,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1418}}}
