{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FXvkrJXjXVrfc9vmfLjCNV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AAAI 2026 reviewer guidelines overall score rating scale 1-10\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://virtual.aistats.org/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2026-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\"},{\"title\":\"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12905618/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer agreement trends from four years of electronic submissions of conference abstract\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1473196/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the AAAI 2026 reviewer guidelines. AAAI 2026 is asking for more fine-grained evaluation based on three key aspects: Soundness, Significance, and Novelty, with reviewers selecting their overall assessment for each item and then providing justification.\n\nHowever, the search results do not contain specific information about a numerical rating scale (1-10) for the overall score. The results indicate there's a focus on qualitative assessments (highly/somewhat/not) for these three categories rather than a numeric 1-10 scale. For the complete and detailed reviewer guidelines including any overall score rating scale information, you may want to visit the official AAAI-26 reviewer instructions page directly at aaai.org.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4933cca-1a32-43f0-a05f-1444489967ad","uuid":"3695bfbb-9f90-48ac-a4dd-5f29eef5fefb","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:34:46.228Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI 2026 reviewer guidelines overall score rating scale 1-10","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01NhkmNMnp5BNvXpfmK85ieX","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines","url":"https://virtual.aistats.org/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuidelines"},{"title":"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2026-statistics/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/"},{"title":"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12905618/"},{"title":"Reviewer agreement trends from four years of electronic submissions of conference abstract","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1473196/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found information about the AAAI 2026 reviewer guidelines. AAAI 2026 is asking for more fine-grained evaluation based on three key aspects: Soundness, Significance, and Novelty, with reviewers selecting their overall assessment for each item and then providing justification.\n\nHowever, the search results do not contain specific information about a numerical rating scale (1-10) for the overall score. The results indicate there's a focus on qualitative assessments (highly/somewhat/not) for these three categories rather than a numeric 1-10 scale. For the complete and detailed review