4.0)\n- 0 Major issues → 可给 Strong Accept (4.5) 或 Award (5.0)\nMajor issue 需有 explicit justification。\n\n**不要评判**：方法实现细节 / 实验设计（那是 Reviewer 1 的范围）、格式 / 排版。\n\n请通过 `review_reviewer_post_to_director(text, reviewer_id=\"2\", project=\"nlp_variance_gtheory\", dream_id=\"20260521T075006\")` 汇报。","reviewer_id":"2","project":"nlp_variance_gtheory","round_number":1},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":395,"cache_read_input_tokens":75506,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":395},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4933cca-1a32-43f0-a05f-1444489967ad","uuid":"7fe6d9ed-b54e-4eff-9c92-5aeabc75b3cc"}
